1
00:00:00,880 --> 00:02:01,140
Visit our website for more: turkision.com

2
00:02:04,389 --> 00:02:08,270
No living being was harmed
during the filming of this series.

3
00:02:08,690 --> 00:02:09,389
Hang them.

4
00:02:09,410 --> 00:02:11,690
Episode 112

5
00:02:11,790 --> 00:02:12,970
Bala!

6
00:02:17,840 --> 00:02:19,090
Archers!

7
00:02:24,110 --> 00:02:25,120
My Sheikh!

8
00:02:28,090 --> 00:02:28,950
Bala!

9
00:02:36,440 --> 00:02:37,350
My Sheikh.

10
00:02:42,800 --> 00:02:43,780
My Sheikh.

11
00:02:44,390 --> 00:02:45,930
- Are you fine?
- Bala.

12
00:02:45,950 --> 00:02:46,700
Bala.

13
00:02:49,410 --> 00:02:51,390
My Sheikh, are you okay?

14
00:02:51,390 --> 00:02:52,490
Fine.

15
00:02:52,490 --> 00:02:53,570
Are you well?

16
00:02:53,570 --> 00:02:54,430
I'm fine, my Bey.

17
00:02:54,430 --> 00:02:55,900
Thank Allah.

18
00:02:56,540 --> 00:02:57,780
Thank Allah.

19
00:03:04,220 --> 00:03:06,500
İsmihan.

20
00:03:10,220 --> 00:03:11,760
İsmihan!

21
00:03:12,380 --> 00:03:13,880
Osman and his Alps
entered the dungeon.

22
00:03:13,890 --> 00:03:15,080
Hurry up, come on.

23
00:03:17,520 --> 00:03:19,940
Shall we help Osman Bey, my Bey?

24
00:03:20,750 --> 00:03:21,910
No.

25
00:03:22,580 --> 00:03:25,890
Our job is to sneak into the castle while
my Bey keeps them busy in the dungeon.

26
00:03:25,900 --> 00:03:28,050
We'll not deviate from our goal.

27
00:03:28,580 --> 00:03:31,710
We'll wait until it is time to
strike the heathen.

28
00:03:32,170 --> 00:03:33,240
Let's go.

29
00:03:38,250 --> 00:03:40,250
You have become one of the cruels.

30
00:03:41,600 --> 00:03:43,490
And you will definitely pay the price.

31
00:03:45,750 --> 00:03:48,210
However, who will pay the price mostly...

32
00:03:49,120 --> 00:03:54,270
are the ones who stood behind you and
remained silent in front of all this injustice.

33
00:03:56,270 --> 00:03:58,480
It will be difficult for them
to reckon with.

34
00:03:58,550 --> 00:03:59,740
Osman Bey.

35
00:04:00,380 --> 00:04:02,480
When those arrows are shot...

36
00:04:02,740 --> 00:04:05,390
your hearts will be harmed.

37
00:04:08,620 --> 00:04:13,490
And my Sultan Alaeddin is about to come.

38
00:04:15,260 --> 00:04:17,649
I will cut off all of your heads.

39
00:04:18,160 --> 00:04:21,079
And I'll wander around
the tribes with them.

40
00:04:23,880 --> 00:04:31,120
That no one would dare to
betray and rebel again.

41
00:04:32,370 --> 00:04:34,380
Let whoever wants come.

42
00:04:36,300 --> 00:04:39,870
If one of us is going to fall
to the ground today...

43
00:04:40,450 --> 00:04:42,550
...we are all ready for that.

44
00:04:47,120 --> 00:04:49,140
The decision is yours, Mother Sultan.

45
00:04:49,770 --> 00:04:54,670
None of you can get
out of this castle alive.

46
00:04:56,280 --> 00:04:57,950
Because I still have the advantage.

47
00:04:59,530 --> 00:05:00,780
Olof.

48
00:05:31,510 --> 00:05:33,540
Are you still here?

49
00:05:34,450 --> 00:05:36,040
I am here, Osman.

50
00:05:36,890 --> 00:05:39,030
I am here to kill you.

51
00:05:40,760 --> 00:05:42,310
Okay, then.

52
00:05:44,420 --> 00:05:46,800
Whoever draws his bow first...

53
00:05:49,990 --> 00:05:52,590
and whoever reaches his
arrow to the target first...

54
00:05:53,970 --> 00:05:55,670
we are ready for it.

55
00:06:06,890 --> 00:06:08,670
But what about you, İsmihan?

56
00:06:10,380 --> 00:06:11,910
Tell me.

57
00:06:14,740 --> 00:06:17,590
If you don't let me get out of
here with my loved ones...

58
00:06:19,930 --> 00:06:21,420
we'll see...

59
00:06:22,230 --> 00:06:24,180
who longs for martyrdom...

60
00:06:24,580 --> 00:06:27,010
and who is afraid of death

61
00:06:38,200 --> 00:06:39,270
Now...

62
00:06:42,010 --> 00:06:44,590
I'll take my Sheikh and Bala
and get out of here.

63
00:06:45,420 --> 00:06:47,400
You can do this, Osman.

64
00:06:52,330 --> 00:06:54,160
If you leave Mesut here...

65
00:06:55,280 --> 00:06:58,120
I can forgive your rudeness.

66
00:07:03,950 --> 00:07:05,930
We have the guts.

67
00:07:07,040 --> 00:07:09,750
But do you have the courage?
Tell us.

68
00:07:10,820 --> 00:07:12,130
Look.

69
00:07:13,420 --> 00:07:16,260
Did you see any hesitation
in my Sheikh?

70
00:07:19,550 --> 00:07:21,410
Look at Bala Hatun.

71
00:07:26,920 --> 00:07:30,120
Did you see any suspicion
of her desire to testify?

72
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:35,040
Look at me
and look at my warriors.

73
00:07:37,610 --> 00:07:40,400
Look into the eyes of those who
are not afraid of death.

74
00:07:41,320 --> 00:07:46,000
Look, so that you can
remember death.

75
00:07:48,080 --> 00:07:49,840
Remember death.

76
00:07:56,140 --> 00:07:59,440
Your common interest that
brought you together...

77
00:08:00,600 --> 00:08:02,230
are greed by force...

78
00:08:04,230 --> 00:08:05,750
and the love of money...

79
00:08:08,050 --> 00:08:09,770
and self love.

80
00:08:11,510 --> 00:08:12,680
Soldiers.

81
00:08:12,710 --> 00:08:16,280
Keep all your arrows
away from the warriors. (Alps.)

82
00:08:16,990 --> 00:08:21,290
Direct them to Osman Bey
and those next to him.

83
00:08:27,410 --> 00:08:32,440
The fastest is the one who kills.

84
00:08:35,000 --> 00:08:36,490
Let's see.

85
00:08:43,390 --> 00:08:47,740
Osman, don't compare me to your
former competitors.

86
00:08:51,170 --> 00:08:55,020
You've never seen anyone like me before.

87
00:08:55,800 --> 00:08:57,020
Let's see.

88
00:08:57,600 --> 00:09:00,620
Hadrat Sultan Alaeddin is coming.

89
00:09:14,780 --> 00:09:15,850
Have you heard?

90
00:09:18,900 --> 00:09:20,890
Look at your fate.

91
00:09:21,630 --> 00:09:24,140
Your death decision (death firman)
is coming

92
00:09:55,490 --> 00:09:58,710
Vice Emperor Kantakuzenos is coming.

93
00:10:52,330 --> 00:10:54,820
What will you do now, Osman Bey?

94
00:11:11,410 --> 00:11:13,460
He has become very weak...

95
00:11:14,210 --> 00:11:16,480
and his body will not bear it.

96
00:11:25,510 --> 00:11:29,740
We belong to Allah and to
Him we shall return.

97
00:11:40,610 --> 00:11:44,210
The dead are increasing day
by day, Kumral Abdal.

98
00:11:44,620 --> 00:11:47,300
Does the treatment you
use never help?

99
00:11:47,540 --> 00:11:51,980
The treatment I'm using doesn't do much
for the frail, Malhun Hatun.

100
00:11:52,250 --> 00:11:54,560
And it does not
benefit the healthy ones.

101
00:11:54,710 --> 00:11:57,440
It only reduces the
effect of the poison.

102
00:11:58,470 --> 00:12:02,450
If I can't find the source of the
poison, I can't find the cure

103
00:12:04,410 --> 00:12:10,100
This snake called İsmihan has brought poison
and antidote from a place we cannot find.

104
00:12:10,940 --> 00:12:15,480
But it is clear
who brought this poison.

105
00:12:16,500 --> 00:12:19,300
It's Marta.
It can't be anyone else.

106
00:12:19,580 --> 00:12:22,170
She and İsmihan are always together.

107
00:12:22,870 --> 00:12:25,750
Moreover, she does not appear
very often in the market.

108
00:12:27,220 --> 00:12:29,650
She conducts all her business in secret.

109
00:12:30,390 --> 00:12:32,970
But we will turn the tide against it.

110
00:12:33,250 --> 00:12:37,060
You and Ülgen will track down Marta.

111
00:12:37,350 --> 00:12:41,570
You will go to all the places she goes
and will find the source of this poison.

112
00:12:42,790 --> 00:12:44,720
Come on, Ülgen.

113
00:12:46,970 --> 00:12:52,150
Esma!
Check out the market well.

114
00:12:52,600 --> 00:12:58,030
Find out who saw and met Marta
recently.

115
00:12:58,400 --> 00:13:00,120
Your command, Malhun Hatun.

116
00:13:01,900 --> 00:13:06,760
Orhan, Aladdin! Bring a stretcher
from outside.

117
00:13:13,270 --> 00:13:17,280
The snake İsmihan started a war on
us by exploiting the lives of our people.

118
00:13:17,680 --> 00:13:21,220
And we will look for all the ways
that lead to healing people.

119
00:13:21,910 --> 00:13:23,690
We will find this antidote.

120
00:13:23,840 --> 00:13:26,430
Inshallah, we will find it, Malhun Hatun.

121
00:13:37,160 --> 00:13:39,150
Lower your swords.

122
00:13:56,550 --> 00:14:01,110
It's up to me here.

123
00:14:03,180 --> 00:14:08,140
Put down your swords, Alps.

124
00:14:18,860 --> 00:14:21,150
Arrest the Alps.

125
00:14:54,380 --> 00:14:59,180
Since you appeared on the scene,
things have not changed, Osman Bey.

126
00:15:00,730 --> 00:15:04,930
The bows are taut and the
swords are always raised.

127
00:15:06,060 --> 00:15:08,300
Is there no limit to your impudency?

128
00:15:08,530 --> 00:15:13,330
There is no limit to which I abide in the place
where my Sheikh and my wife are imprisoned.

129
00:15:19,500 --> 00:15:24,710
If we had not heard what you did and
had not seen it with our own eyes...

130
00:15:24,980 --> 00:15:27,840
we'd be sad about your
condition, Osman Bey.

131
00:15:42,130 --> 00:15:44,660
Welcome, Hadrat Sultan.

132
00:15:45,300 --> 00:15:48,950
Conditions here are as you can see.

133
00:15:54,840 --> 00:15:58,270
I see things clearly, Mother Sultan.

134
00:16:00,330 --> 00:16:04,180
But the situation of Sheikh Edebali...

135
00:16:08,340 --> 00:16:10,600
isn't good.

136
00:16:12,180 --> 00:16:19,920
But the disobedience of
Osman Bey and his wife is evident.

137
00:16:31,640 --> 00:16:38,260
Hadrat Sultan Alaeddin, as you said, their
guilt is clearly visible.

138
00:16:39,150 --> 00:16:44,420
They committed crimes not only
against Konya, but also against Byzantium.

139
00:16:45,590 --> 00:16:48,580
They will be judged first in my court.

140
00:16:49,620 --> 00:16:56,240
Is the Viceroy equal to the Sultan that
you ask me for something, Kantakuzenos?

141
00:16:57,540 --> 00:17:02,339
Osman Bey will be judged in my court.

142
00:17:04,460 --> 00:17:08,690
- Hadrat Sultan.
- Kantakuzenos.

143
00:17:13,220 --> 00:17:17,890
If you fear for your soul,
go now.

144
00:17:27,119 --> 00:17:28,820
Let it be as you want it now.

145
00:17:30,760 --> 00:17:32,460
But just for now.

146
00:17:38,770 --> 00:17:41,220
Take your useless men with you.

147
00:18:09,070 --> 00:18:12,520
A trial will be held for
Osman Bey and his wife.

148
00:18:13,840 --> 00:18:19,010
Even if his guilt is proven by evidence...

149
00:18:19,790 --> 00:18:22,370
we'll be holding a trial though.

150
00:18:24,130 --> 00:18:26,020
Take him to the dungeon.

151
00:18:28,650 --> 00:18:31,120
Hands off!

152
00:18:34,610 --> 00:18:37,630
I know very well where the dungeon
is in this castle.

153
00:18:39,480 --> 00:18:41,950
Because Marmaracık belongs to me.

154
00:18:42,890 --> 00:18:46,690
Like all the lands
you trample in the borderlands.

155
00:18:48,290 --> 00:18:53,600
It's possible that all your property will be
taken away from you after the court, Osman Bey.

156
00:19:02,680 --> 00:19:04,470
Take them.

157
00:19:18,340 --> 00:19:20,730
This world is mortal, my Sultan.

158
00:19:22,750 --> 00:19:24,720
Mortal.

159
00:19:42,200 --> 00:19:46,230
It is a mortal world for everyone.

160
00:19:47,270 --> 00:19:49,160
For everyone.

161
00:20:30,620 --> 00:20:31,930
İsmihan...---

162
00:20:33,380 --> 00:20:35,280
Mother Sultan.

163
00:20:36,730 --> 00:20:39,810
Is Osman the only person
who should be held accountable?

164
00:20:40,100 --> 00:20:41,520
Bengi Hatun.

165
00:20:41,590 --> 00:20:44,390
What is Olof doing here?

166
00:20:44,990 --> 00:20:46,990
Olof is my brother's killer.

167
00:20:47,210 --> 00:20:50,970
This is not where
we talk about that.

168
00:20:51,530 --> 00:20:53,580
Come with me.

169
00:21:17,140 --> 00:21:19,780
My Allah, help us.

170
00:21:26,300 --> 00:21:29,920
When did your symptoms begin?
How long have you been like this?

171
00:21:30,180 --> 00:21:33,470
Yesterday was the first day and today
is the second day, Kumral Abdal.

172
00:21:33,600 --> 00:21:35,330
Come on, let's go inside.

173
00:21:35,570 --> 00:21:37,720
Let's check your wounds first,
come on.

174
00:21:37,960 --> 00:21:39,290
Let's go.

175
00:21:44,950 --> 00:21:46,870
It has been spread to the
entire market.

176
00:21:46,930 --> 00:21:48,370
To the sales tables.

177
00:21:52,960 --> 00:21:54,000
Görklüce.

178
00:21:54,260 --> 00:21:57,110
Collect everything on the
sales tables and burn it.

179
00:21:57,360 --> 00:21:59,390
Determine the homes that
aren't infected.

180
00:21:59,420 --> 00:22:00,670
Don't let them out.

181
00:22:00,690 --> 00:22:02,690
Your command, Malhun Hatun.

182
00:22:05,460 --> 00:22:06,450
Mother.

183
00:22:06,510 --> 00:22:09,470
If people do not die of poison,
they will perish from hunger.

184
00:22:09,650 --> 00:22:11,010
Convoys don't come.

185
00:22:11,780 --> 00:22:13,010
The stores are empty.

186
00:22:13,910 --> 00:22:17,780
The supplies of the Kayi tribe
will suffice us for yet another time.

187
00:22:18,050 --> 00:22:20,160
The disease has not yet reached there.

188
00:22:20,530 --> 00:22:22,360
We'll manage with those supplies.

189
00:22:23,620 --> 00:22:25,170
Then what, my mother Malhun?

190
00:22:28,960 --> 00:22:29,840
Malhun.

191
00:22:30,360 --> 00:22:31,490
Ayşe.

192
00:22:33,170 --> 00:22:35,720
There's nothing in Marta's shop

193
00:22:35,970 --> 00:22:37,810
We turned it upside down.

194
00:22:38,000 --> 00:22:39,220
We searched everywhere.

195
00:22:39,220 --> 00:22:41,220
There is nothing but fabrics.

196
00:22:41,840 --> 00:22:43,480
There will certainly be a track.

197
00:22:43,500 --> 00:22:46,140
We will find it.
We have no other solution.

198
00:22:49,160 --> 00:22:50,180
Malhun Hatun.

199
00:22:51,410 --> 00:22:52,340
Malhun Hatun

200
00:22:52,950 --> 00:22:54,030
Marta.

201
00:22:54,080 --> 00:22:56,360
She rented a shop from a merchant.

202
00:22:57,040 --> 00:22:59,270
And she put her things there.

203
00:22:59,270 --> 00:23:00,690
Who is he? Did you find him?

204
00:23:00,690 --> 00:23:03,700
The owner hasn't been around for a while.

205
00:23:04,260 --> 00:23:05,640
No one knows his exact location.

206
00:23:05,650 --> 00:23:07,240
You will find that man, Esma.

207
00:23:07,270 --> 00:23:09,270
We have time until the end of the day.

208
00:23:09,280 --> 00:23:11,950
You will go into every hole in the city
if you have to.

209
00:23:11,960 --> 00:23:13,130
You will find that warehouse.

210
00:23:13,150 --> 00:23:14,830
Your command, Malhun Hatun.

211
00:23:15,090 --> 00:23:15,830
Ayşe.

212
00:23:16,120 --> 00:23:17,990
Tell the Alps to get ready.

213
00:23:17,990 --> 00:23:19,990
We'll go into that warehouse tonight.

214
00:23:26,480 --> 00:23:27,250
Get out.

215
00:23:31,910 --> 00:23:34,230
How do you do this to us, Mother Sultan?

216
00:23:34,880 --> 00:23:36,600
I trusted you.

217
00:23:36,960 --> 00:23:39,040
But it turns out that there is no
difference between you and Osman.

218
00:23:39,110 --> 00:23:39,890
Watch out.

219
00:23:40,580 --> 00:23:42,470
Bengi Hatun,
watch out.

220
00:23:42,480 --> 00:23:43,830
You..

221
00:23:44,040 --> 00:23:45,620
You have betrayed us.

222
00:23:46,100 --> 00:23:49,270
You united with the dog Olof who
spilled my brother's blood.

223
00:23:49,290 --> 00:23:52,380
As if that wasn't enough, you brought
him into our house, too.

224
00:23:52,390 --> 00:23:54,390
So many things happened.

225
00:23:54,410 --> 00:23:57,510
- Are you really angry about this?
- Of course!

226
00:23:58,480 --> 00:23:59,480
Those dogs...

227
00:23:59,750 --> 00:24:01,920
spilled my brother's blood...

228
00:24:02,290 --> 00:24:03,410
and then..

229
00:24:03,700 --> 00:24:06,140
hurled slander at my husband and daughter.

230
00:24:06,160 --> 00:24:10,020
I almost lost my husband and my
tribe because of those dogs.

231
00:24:10,130 --> 00:24:12,690
Since you united with them...

232
00:24:14,000 --> 00:24:16,230
Since you did not see our pain...

233
00:24:16,260 --> 00:24:19,780
and worked with them instead
of avenging us...

234
00:24:20,880 --> 00:24:22,230
It is over, Mother Sultan.

235
00:24:23,510 --> 00:24:25,360
Walk the road alone from now on.

236
00:24:25,800 --> 00:24:26,880
I'm out.

237
00:24:27,120 --> 00:24:29,780
Don't push your limits, Bengi Hatun.

238
00:24:33,700 --> 00:24:36,470
Did you think you could turn
your back on me so easily?

239
00:24:38,360 --> 00:24:39,460
First...

240
00:24:39,920 --> 00:24:43,440
You will listen to me, your Mother Sultan.

241
00:24:44,180 --> 00:24:46,200
I have nothing to listen to.

242
00:24:46,220 --> 00:24:47,160
How dare you?

243
00:24:49,120 --> 00:24:50,150
Shame on you.

244
00:24:51,510 --> 00:24:53,600
I thought you were a smart woman.

245
00:24:53,630 --> 00:24:55,910
Don't you know about politics?

246
00:24:57,650 --> 00:24:59,480
How can you be a Bey's wife?

247
00:24:59,500 --> 00:25:01,900
I don't understand
politics, Mother Sultan.

248
00:25:02,550 --> 00:25:04,360
But there is something I know.

249
00:25:04,960 --> 00:25:07,750
You and Osman are the same.

250
00:25:07,750 --> 00:25:11,030
You can't equate me with
that rebellious Osman.

251
00:25:11,810 --> 00:25:14,600
I am the Mother Sultan of the Seljuk state.

252
00:25:15,730 --> 00:25:19,880
And I know what Olof did to
you and all the Turkmens!

253
00:25:21,280 --> 00:25:24,240
I did not choose to
fight him like Osman.

254
00:25:25,000 --> 00:25:29,680
I control my enemy by holding
him in my hands.

255
00:25:29,760 --> 00:25:33,040
He can't take any step without my command.

256
00:25:34,800 --> 00:25:37,350
I will hit a dog with the dog.

257
00:25:38,360 --> 00:25:39,350
Don't you see?

258
00:25:40,000 --> 00:25:46,020
Have you heard that Olof has attacked
a single tribe or a single Turk since I came?

259
00:25:47,410 --> 00:25:48,710
You can't hear.

260
00:25:49,600 --> 00:25:52,210
Because he can't.

261
00:25:53,160 --> 00:25:54,210
And now...

262
00:25:55,000 --> 00:25:57,680
In order to control
Osman with my own hands...

263
00:25:58,440 --> 00:26:00,160
I need Olof.

264
00:26:01,220 --> 00:26:02,240
But don't...

265
00:26:03,250 --> 00:26:07,460
think I'll forget what he did
to you and your tribe.

266
00:26:08,550 --> 00:26:11,640
I don't forget anything.

267
00:26:13,720 --> 00:26:15,240
And when the time comes...

268
00:26:16,580 --> 00:26:19,810
Olof will get his punishment.

269
00:26:20,690 --> 00:26:21,540
However...

270
00:26:22,150 --> 00:26:26,740
If you try to interrogate me again...

271
00:26:26,740 --> 00:26:31,280
I will separate your head
from your body!

272
00:26:31,300 --> 00:26:33,670
Don't, Bengi Hatun.

273
00:26:38,640 --> 00:26:40,395
Now...

274
00:26:40,430 --> 00:26:42,830
I will ignore that

275
00:26:44,820 --> 00:26:46,710
And I am sorry for your pain.

276
00:26:47,780 --> 00:26:50,820
You know I love you, Bengi Hatun.

277
00:26:51,720 --> 00:26:53,800
Don't force me.

278
00:26:54,480 --> 00:26:57,480
And let's burn those who burned our souls.

279
00:27:00,470 --> 00:27:02,040
Are you with me now?

280
00:27:05,510 --> 00:27:07,250
I'm with you, Mother Sultan.

281
00:27:09,280 --> 00:27:10,450
Forgive me.

282
00:27:11,590 --> 00:27:13,140
Okay, then.

283
00:27:15,990 --> 00:27:17,910
Now, go to your Öktem Bey.

284
00:27:19,700 --> 00:27:21,700
Explain to him what I told you.

285
00:27:21,730 --> 00:27:23,110
Explain to him, so that...

286
00:27:23,620 --> 00:27:25,970
he doesn't have any suspicions.

287
00:27:26,370 --> 00:27:27,430
Bengi Hatun.

288
00:27:28,740 --> 00:27:29,990
Mother Sultan.

289
00:27:59,490 --> 00:28:00,980
What will we do, Osman?

290
00:28:02,580 --> 00:28:04,200
Don't ever worry.

291
00:28:04,800 --> 00:28:08,740
We'll tie these chains, with which they
tied our hands, around their necks.

292
00:28:12,690 --> 00:28:15,080
Oh! Osman Bey!

293
00:28:19,510 --> 00:28:21,360
Whenever i see you...

294
00:28:22,160 --> 00:28:24,550
Your hands are always
inside the chains like this.

295
00:28:25,430 --> 00:28:29,340
The noose will be around your neck.

296
00:28:31,380 --> 00:28:35,270
Those who are on the path of truth
always have a noose around their necks.

297
00:28:38,260 --> 00:28:40,390
And every time I see you...

298
00:28:41,680 --> 00:28:44,660
I see you waiting for the
wolf to fall like a hyena.

299
00:28:46,210 --> 00:28:48,500
Do not blame me, Osman Bey.

300
00:28:48,950 --> 00:28:50,310
But..

301
00:28:50,580 --> 00:28:54,050
Some will fall
so that we can rise.

302
00:28:58,550 --> 00:29:00,830
Where you're going to is dark.
It's clear.

303
00:29:01,170 --> 00:29:02,850
But saying so is a habit.

304
00:29:02,870 --> 00:29:04,240
May your path be open.

305
00:29:05,120 --> 00:29:08,020
We have faced a lot of darkness so far.

306
00:29:09,570 --> 00:29:10,680
But what about you?

307
00:29:14,310 --> 00:29:17,080
You will spend your life
in that darkness...

308
00:29:30,480 --> 00:29:32,690
Bayındır.

309
00:29:34,260 --> 00:29:36,440
You tremble so nervously.

310
00:29:38,000 --> 00:29:39,920
If you continue like this...

311
00:29:42,560 --> 00:29:45,010
I will tear you apart.

312
00:29:47,620 --> 00:29:48,850
Take him.

313
00:29:50,640 --> 00:29:52,200
Take me, of course.

314
00:30:16,680 --> 00:30:18,000
I will take Osman.

315
00:30:18,360 --> 00:30:20,000
I will take Osman.

316
00:30:21,430 --> 00:30:23,360
Andronikos is about to recover.

317
00:30:23,360 --> 00:30:25,360
I can't keep him in bed any longer.

318
00:30:26,340 --> 00:30:27,360
Then kill him.

319
00:30:28,870 --> 00:30:29,910
Bury him in the dirt.

320
00:30:30,710 --> 00:30:32,360
He won't get up then.

321
00:30:33,030 --> 00:30:34,000
No.

322
00:30:35,080 --> 00:30:36,420
No, Olof.

323
00:30:36,850 --> 00:30:39,960
I need strength to be a legitimate ruler.

324
00:30:40,840 --> 00:30:42,980
I've been striving for
this for a long time.

325
00:30:43,330 --> 00:30:45,510
Killing Andronikos is not a solution.

326
00:30:47,120 --> 00:30:48,240
That power...

327
00:30:48,930 --> 00:30:50,240
Is it the holy cross?

328
00:30:53,860 --> 00:30:55,360
Definitely.

329
00:30:55,780 --> 00:30:57,360
We will take Osman...

330
00:30:57,360 --> 00:30:59,870
and he will tell us
where the cross is.

331
00:31:01,750 --> 00:31:05,160
Otherwise, I wouldn't be able to
protect this power anymore.

332
00:31:06,440 --> 00:31:10,000
Shall we try to make him live?

333
00:31:10,270 --> 00:31:13,520
Until he tells us where
the cross is, Olof.

334
00:31:13,890 --> 00:31:18,180
The rest is up to you.

335
00:31:23,000 --> 00:31:25,020
We will take Osman.

336
00:31:25,490 --> 00:31:27,850
And you will get the cross.

337
00:31:29,510 --> 00:31:30,880
And I will cut his head off.

338
00:31:33,680 --> 00:31:35,320
How will we take him?

339
00:31:42,180 --> 00:31:43,270
Gentlemen.

340
00:31:59,000 --> 00:32:01,360
Marmaracık Castle

341
00:32:02,020 --> 00:32:05,110
Forgive my mother, Sheikh Edebali.

342
00:32:05,870 --> 00:32:08,570
We seek forgiveness from
saints of Allah like you.

343
00:32:09,860 --> 00:32:11,350
Hadrat Sultan.

344
00:32:12,610 --> 00:32:14,240
The dungeon...

345
00:32:15,140 --> 00:32:18,710
is a place where we nurture ourselves.

346
00:32:19,810 --> 00:32:25,820
We're free everywhere we
remember Allah in our hearts.

347
00:32:27,120 --> 00:32:28,170
However...

348
00:32:29,300 --> 00:32:32,350
Those who remove the mention
of Allah from their hearts...

349
00:32:32,990 --> 00:32:36,140
even if they think they are free...

350
00:32:37,230 --> 00:32:39,390
They are always prisoners.

351
00:32:41,280 --> 00:32:44,520
May Allah protect us from being
like those, Sheikh Edebali.

352
00:32:45,710 --> 00:32:48,210
I want to host you.

353
00:32:50,150 --> 00:32:51,400
Thank you.

354
00:32:53,150 --> 00:32:54,540
But I will refuse.

355
00:32:56,690 --> 00:32:59,310
Being a guest in this property...

356
00:32:59,320 --> 00:33:01,920
where Osman Bey and my
daughter are prisoners...

357
00:33:02,280 --> 00:33:03,280
is cruel for me.

358
00:33:10,280 --> 00:33:12,410
Either you put me in dungeon too...

359
00:33:14,710 --> 00:33:16,520
or let me go.

360
00:33:17,790 --> 00:33:20,430
Do not be of the
oppressors, my Sultan.

361
00:33:23,130 --> 00:33:25,210
Doing justice is not cruel.

362
00:33:27,130 --> 00:33:28,800
Every move has a result.

363
00:33:33,040 --> 00:33:36,250
But you are free, unlike your children.

364
00:33:37,630 --> 00:33:38,680
You can go.

365
00:33:43,040 --> 00:33:44,350
Also, Sheikh Edebali...

366
00:33:49,740 --> 00:33:51,240
your grandson Aladdin...

367
00:33:52,100 --> 00:33:54,580
is very smart and quick-witted.

368
00:33:57,700 --> 00:33:59,330
But his father, Osman Bey...

369
00:34:02,070 --> 00:34:04,480
exploits his qualities in his
own games.

370
00:34:05,429 --> 00:34:08,219
Alaeddin growing up with him
is not a good thing.

371
00:34:10,840 --> 00:34:12,739
Alaeddin will come with me to Konya.

372
00:34:16,219 --> 00:34:18,420
I will personally take care of him.

373
00:34:28,150 --> 00:34:31,620
Only Osman Bey can let that.

374
00:34:33,630 --> 00:34:34,840
However...

375
00:34:35,620 --> 00:34:38,929
As you're so greedy...

376
00:34:40,139 --> 00:34:44,250
We have no sons to leave to you.

377
00:34:45,270 --> 00:34:46,440
You should know that.

378
00:34:51,159 --> 00:34:53,010
However, you ask his father anyway.

379
00:35:05,000 --> 00:35:07,790
I will ask him, Edebali I will
ask him.

380
00:35:08,680 --> 00:35:09,980
Don't worry.

381
00:35:12,330 --> 00:35:14,380
I have many questions to ask Osman.

382
00:35:19,890 --> 00:35:21,210
My Sultan.

383
00:35:22,510 --> 00:35:24,810
Not my prerogative, however...

384
00:35:26,550 --> 00:35:29,720
Even Sheikh Edebali is among these tricks.

385
00:35:33,260 --> 00:35:34,850
He doesn't deserve your respect.

386
00:35:35,680 --> 00:35:38,070
Do you think I don't
know that, Vizier?

387
00:35:40,360 --> 00:35:43,320
There is something my mother
did not reckon with.

388
00:35:43,750 --> 00:35:45,840
Edebali is respected in Konya, too.

389
00:35:46,330 --> 00:35:48,720
I can't make my followers stand
against me.

390
00:35:48,860 --> 00:35:50,780
We are observing him now.

391
00:35:53,390 --> 00:35:54,990
Your command, my Sultan.

392
00:35:56,290 --> 00:35:59,250
And what about Osman Bey?

393
00:36:00,150 --> 00:36:03,520
He kidnapped my uncle Mesut
and wanted to dethrone me, Saveli.

394
00:36:05,360 --> 00:36:06,860
His end is clear.

395
00:36:07,800 --> 00:36:09,420
The court is only a formality.

396
00:36:13,210 --> 00:36:14,790
His head will be cut off.

397
00:36:19,160 --> 00:36:20,470
Let's see.

398
00:36:25,320 --> 00:36:27,580
Allah is the greatest.

399
00:36:35,310 --> 00:36:37,230
Allah is the greatest.

400
00:36:42,510 --> 00:36:44,060
Allah is the greatest.

401
00:36:48,480 --> 00:36:50,310
Allah is the greatest.

402
00:37:15,840 --> 00:37:20,260
Peace and Allah's mercy be upon you.

403
00:37:30,330 --> 00:37:31,360
My Allah.

404
00:37:33,130 --> 00:37:35,700
Our way is your way, my Allah.

405
00:37:37,010 --> 00:37:41,300
Our way is to spread your
name all over the world.

406
00:37:42,270 --> 00:37:44,790
Your oppression is as beautiful
as your kindness.

407
00:37:45,190 --> 00:37:46,340
My Allah.

408
00:37:48,410 --> 00:37:53,070
Don't leave those who
walk in your way in dungeons.

409
00:37:54,100 --> 00:37:55,270
My Allah.

410
00:37:56,540 --> 00:37:57,890
On this difficult day...

411
00:37:58,280 --> 00:38:01,330
Our thanks will be no less than
in our days of prosperity.

412
00:38:01,830 --> 00:38:03,180
Have mercy on us.

413
00:38:03,880 --> 00:38:06,350
We fight for your satisfaction.

414
00:38:06,870 --> 00:38:10,780
We are fighting to honor the
world with your rules.

415
00:38:11,540 --> 00:38:13,170
You know our hearts.

416
00:38:14,900 --> 00:38:17,290
Protect the hearts that
beat for you, my Allah.

417
00:38:18,150 --> 00:38:19,420
My Allah.

418
00:38:20,270 --> 00:38:25,040
We're fighting between all
these heathens and infidels.

419
00:38:25,580 --> 00:38:27,440
Don't leave us alone.

420
00:38:28,660 --> 00:38:29,820
My Allah.

421
00:38:30,290 --> 00:38:33,830
We have no refuge but you.

422
00:38:34,390 --> 00:38:36,100
Don't leave us alone.

423
00:38:37,090 --> 00:38:39,570
Don't leave us alone, my Allah.

424
00:38:41,800 --> 00:38:43,650
Accept our prayer, my Allah.

425
00:38:44,290 --> 00:38:45,750
Amin.

426
00:38:48,070 --> 00:38:49,390
Amin.

427
00:38:54,890 --> 00:38:55,970
Dear Bala.

428
00:39:11,270 --> 00:39:13,650
- Dear Bala.
- Dear Osman.

429
00:39:15,520 --> 00:39:18,390
Since our prayers are the same,
we won't stay here, my dear.

430
00:39:18,430 --> 00:39:21,500
Don't worry,
we'll get out of here.

431
00:39:23,210 --> 00:39:24,480
We are here.

432
00:39:25,270 --> 00:39:26,990
But what about those
on the outside?

433
00:39:27,040 --> 00:39:28,610
Sons?
The palace?

434
00:39:29,330 --> 00:39:31,090
What are they going
through now?

435
00:39:31,280 --> 00:39:32,660
You told me about a
disease.

436
00:39:32,690 --> 00:39:34,220
My Allah is everyone's Allah.

437
00:39:35,160 --> 00:39:36,790
Allah will protect them too, Bala.

438
00:39:37,440 --> 00:39:41,020
Our children and the people of
the palace are vigilant people.

439
00:39:41,930 --> 00:39:43,940
They'll get over it,
don't worry.

440
00:39:45,460 --> 00:39:46,520
Yes.

441
00:39:48,410 --> 00:39:49,530
And what about us?

442
00:39:51,760 --> 00:39:56,110
İsmihan and Sultan Alaeddin
are like-minded.

443
00:39:57,550 --> 00:39:59,880
Sultan Alaeddin's concern
is to achieve justice.

444
00:40:00,050 --> 00:40:02,660
As for İsmihan, she may have
other plans.

445
00:40:02,920 --> 00:40:05,580
They want to take advantage
of our death too.

446
00:40:15,760 --> 00:40:18,840
Osman Bey,
Sultan Alaeddin wants to see you.

447
00:40:21,170 --> 00:40:22,240
Osman!

448
00:40:26,540 --> 00:40:28,030
Come on, then.

449
00:40:33,170 --> 00:40:34,690
I know.

450
00:40:34,890 --> 00:40:36,450
Things got a little complicated.

451
00:40:36,460 --> 00:40:39,180
It got complicated, and it got complicated
a lot.

452
00:40:39,710 --> 00:40:42,630
Why did Sultan Alaeddin
make such a decision, Mother Sultan?

453
00:40:43,520 --> 00:40:46,060
We've agreed that you will give me Osman.

454
00:40:46,770 --> 00:40:47,770
If the opposite...

455
00:40:47,800 --> 00:40:52,560
Children disobey orders
sometimes, Kantakuzenos.

456
00:40:54,330 --> 00:40:56,460
They may have personal moves...

457
00:40:56,560 --> 00:40:59,020
and the words carry the
meaning of rebellion...

458
00:40:59,440 --> 00:41:01,600
especially when you are a Sultan.

459
00:41:05,230 --> 00:41:06,730
But he is my son.

460
00:41:09,240 --> 00:41:11,170
That is why I have mercy on him.

461
00:41:31,320 --> 00:41:35,000
Why would I show you
the same mercy?

462
00:41:37,740 --> 00:41:39,240
Are you my son?

463
00:41:40,680 --> 00:41:43,570
Choose the right words, Kantakuzenos.

464
00:41:49,150 --> 00:41:50,440
Have you calmed down?

465
00:42:02,280 --> 00:42:04,170
It is easy to educate children.

466
00:42:05,950 --> 00:42:08,040
But when you want to teach
men something...

467
00:42:09,270 --> 00:42:11,180
you must threaten them with their lives.

468
00:42:14,690 --> 00:42:16,220
As for Osman's life...

469
00:42:18,500 --> 00:42:21,710
You are the one who will
kill him, Kantakuzenos.

470
00:42:22,920 --> 00:42:27,650
If you provided us with this information from
the beginning, there'd be no need for this show.

471
00:42:27,690 --> 00:42:29,740
Where and when
will I kill Osman?

472
00:42:32,260 --> 00:42:33,750
If he dies in my castle...

473
00:42:34,820 --> 00:42:37,710
I will be in a bad position
in front of my people.

474
00:42:38,600 --> 00:42:41,170
This evening, before the court...

475
00:42:41,430 --> 00:42:44,580
You will take him from dungeon.

476
00:42:46,200 --> 00:42:51,660
And I'll announce that he's a
disobedient person and a fugitive.

477
00:42:53,330 --> 00:42:54,380
Good.

478
00:42:55,240 --> 00:42:57,330
So, I am waiting for news from you.

479
00:43:47,650 --> 00:43:52,460
Do you know why I haven't
killed you yet, Osman Bey?

480
00:43:55,620 --> 00:43:57,790
Because you are a coward.

481
00:44:02,930 --> 00:44:08,070
You always give me a reason to kill you.

482
00:44:13,730 --> 00:44:16,590
The light of Konya is almost extinguished.

483
00:44:19,580 --> 00:44:23,670
Even if you try to
hide it, it is.

484
00:44:28,020 --> 00:44:31,510
The light of the conquests
shines in the borders now.

485
00:44:33,300 --> 00:44:35,760
And you are afraid of this.

486
00:44:40,250 --> 00:44:42,430
You haven't killed me yet.

487
00:44:45,810 --> 00:44:47,770
You want to do everything properly...

488
00:44:48,820 --> 00:44:52,000
and you want to solve that in
the court.

489
00:44:52,330 --> 00:44:57,600
Thus, the legitimacy of
your authority will not be harmed.

490
00:45:05,290 --> 00:45:08,230
Men who know a lot
don't live long, Osman Bey.

491
00:45:11,970 --> 00:45:13,820
This is the cause of your death.

492
00:45:16,890 --> 00:45:20,170
Tomorrow, when you're judged
and beheaded...

493
00:45:21,160 --> 00:45:23,720
I will take your son Aladdin
and return to Konya.

494
00:45:30,570 --> 00:45:33,770
Even if I die, you cannot take
my son from me.

495
00:45:43,400 --> 00:45:45,430
My homeland...

496
00:45:47,150 --> 00:45:49,420
will protect my son.

497
00:45:52,240 --> 00:45:55,470
While you can't stand against me...

498
00:45:55,690 --> 00:45:58,950
Who can stand against me
and prevent that, Osman Bey?

499
00:46:04,230 --> 00:46:06,210
Don't get this out of your mind.

500
00:46:09,060 --> 00:46:14,610
The flag of Islam is above
the throne on which you sit.

501
00:46:18,150 --> 00:46:19,900
Even if we fall...

502
00:46:20,530 --> 00:46:24,620
one of them will definitely come and
carry that banner of Islam.

503
00:46:30,020 --> 00:46:31,610
As for my son...

504
00:46:32,330 --> 00:46:33,910
You cannot take my son.

505
00:46:35,370 --> 00:46:36,670
But...

506
00:46:39,420 --> 00:46:41,600
My son will take
many things from you.

507
00:46:44,720 --> 00:46:46,180
What is the meaning of this?

508
00:46:48,390 --> 00:46:51,580
We'll all see when the time comes.

509
00:46:55,670 --> 00:46:57,590
We'll see, Osman Bey.

510
00:46:58,600 --> 00:47:00,160
We'll see.

511
00:47:03,810 --> 00:47:06,180
Take Osman Bey to the place he deserves.

512
00:47:07,130 --> 00:47:08,520
To the dungeon.

513
00:47:21,570 --> 00:47:24,310
Osman Bey's Palace - Yenişehir

514
00:47:27,430 --> 00:47:29,640
The store has two entrances, Ayşe.

515
00:47:30,120 --> 00:47:32,480
Ülgen and I will enter through
the front entrance.

516
00:47:32,560 --> 00:47:35,190
You and the Alps will sneak
up from behind.

517
00:47:35,400 --> 00:47:37,570
We'll catch her without scaring her.

518
00:47:37,780 --> 00:47:39,730
I need that snake alive.

519
00:47:41,540 --> 00:47:45,970
Orhan Bey, Aladdin Bey,
this place is entrusted to you.

520
00:47:57,150 --> 00:47:58,500
Grandfather Sheikh.

521
00:48:02,350 --> 00:48:03,490
- My Sheikh
- My Sheikh.

522
00:48:03,520 --> 00:48:04,710
Are you okay, my
Sheikh?

523
00:48:04,750 --> 00:48:07,700
I'm fine.

524
00:48:08,120 --> 00:48:11,240
I'm fine, but how are you?

525
00:48:11,320 --> 00:48:12,460
My Sheikh.

526
00:48:12,570 --> 00:48:13,610
Malhun.

527
00:48:15,210 --> 00:48:16,780
There is a disease, my Sheikh.

528
00:48:17,360 --> 00:48:19,040
We will tell you later.

529
00:48:19,220 --> 00:48:20,550
First, are you okay?

530
00:48:20,710 --> 00:48:22,120
I'm fine, fine

531
00:48:23,440 --> 00:48:26,490
Where are my mother and father, my Sheikh?

532
00:48:30,290 --> 00:48:34,340
Osman Bey and Bala are
in Marmaracık Dungeon.

533
00:48:36,670 --> 00:48:43,730
Sultan Alaeddin ordered that they
remain locked up until their trial.

534
00:48:47,190 --> 00:48:50,110
The verdict that will be
issued by the court is known.

535
00:48:52,490 --> 00:48:55,550
We can't leave my father and Bala
mother alone there, my Sheikh.

536
00:48:55,580 --> 00:48:57,410
We will definitely not leave them.

537
00:48:58,170 --> 00:49:00,000
We will not leave them.

538
00:49:03,180 --> 00:49:04,370
My Sheikh.

539
00:49:04,590 --> 00:49:07,470
Where are Boran, Cerkutay and
the rest of the Alps?

540
00:49:08,250 --> 00:49:10,840
They were stationed near Marmaracık.

541
00:49:11,030 --> 00:49:14,410
They will enter the castle and
take Osman Bey.

542
00:49:15,640 --> 00:49:18,480
Well then, we'll take them together.

543
00:49:19,390 --> 00:49:22,520
While disturbing the mind
of the snake İsmihan...

544
00:49:22,720 --> 00:49:25,050
The Alps will save my Bey and Bala.

545
00:49:25,990 --> 00:49:30,130
And now, the sons of Osman Bey
will rise as they deserve.

546
00:49:31,040 --> 00:49:34,500
You will protect Yenişehir even if
it cost you your lives.

547
00:49:34,960 --> 00:49:38,530
You both will take all
precautions regarding illness.

548
00:49:39,330 --> 00:49:41,540
And you both will make judgments.

549
00:49:41,920 --> 00:49:42,960
Your command, mother.

550
00:49:43,160 --> 00:49:44,290
Your command, mother.

551
00:49:44,910 --> 00:49:47,750
Görklüce, prepare my horse.

552
00:49:49,980 --> 00:49:52,580
Marmaracık Castle

553
00:49:54,080 --> 00:49:56,550
Let Kantakouzanos in silently.

554
00:49:57,050 --> 00:49:58,890
I will distract the Sultan.

555
00:50:13,080 --> 00:50:14,230
Mother Sultan.

556
00:50:20,120 --> 00:50:21,870
My lion son.

557
00:50:22,660 --> 00:50:24,160
Mashallah!

558
00:50:24,950 --> 00:50:28,180
Your arrival established
order in the borders.

559
00:50:29,070 --> 00:50:30,890
Osman is in our hands now.

560
00:50:31,910 --> 00:50:34,220
His death warrant will be
issued by the court.

561
00:50:34,340 --> 00:50:35,630
We won.

562
00:50:35,980 --> 00:50:37,570
We won, my Sultan.

563
00:50:38,420 --> 00:50:40,510
Thanks to your ability.

564
00:50:40,790 --> 00:50:44,680
This success will be enough
to scare our enemies.

565
00:50:44,950 --> 00:50:47,840
Your share is great in
this success, mother.

566
00:50:48,540 --> 00:50:52,540
But when we put the rope
on Osman's neck...

567
00:50:53,100 --> 00:50:55,230
the people will not remain silent.

568
00:50:56,610 --> 00:51:00,910
The people will accept
that Osman is a rebel.

569
00:51:01,400 --> 00:51:04,520
And they will remain silent
about his death, my Sultan.

570
00:51:04,900 --> 00:51:08,780
Don't think about these issues
and tire yourself..

571
00:51:09,770 --> 00:51:11,670
It's true what you say, mother.

572
00:51:12,440 --> 00:51:14,240
You come from a long way.

573
00:51:14,320 --> 00:51:17,090
I will prepare a beautiful table for you.

574
00:51:18,270 --> 00:51:19,970
For our sultan...

575
00:51:28,500 --> 00:51:30,350
Hadrat Sultan.

576
00:51:42,830 --> 00:51:45,360
We'll move on quietly from here.

577
00:51:46,440 --> 00:51:49,180
Ten men are enough for me.

578
00:51:51,510 --> 00:51:53,530
Are my men in the castle, Avcı?

579
00:51:53,640 --> 00:51:56,190
They are all inside.

580
00:51:56,590 --> 00:51:57,820
Kantakuzenos.

581
00:51:58,340 --> 00:52:01,120
Did your sword collide
with Osman before?

582
00:52:03,670 --> 00:52:05,920
I fought with Osman several times...

583
00:52:06,480 --> 00:52:08,140
and with his wife Bala.

584
00:52:09,410 --> 00:52:14,180
I do not praise my enemy but
you have to be realistic.

585
00:52:15,260 --> 00:52:17,380
I'm very realistic, Olof.

586
00:52:17,630 --> 00:52:19,450
Very realistic.

587
00:52:20,170 --> 00:52:22,760
Our primary target is not Osman.

588
00:52:23,120 --> 00:52:24,370
Rather, it's his wife.

589
00:52:24,750 --> 00:52:27,450
When you put the
dagger to her throat...

590
00:52:27,670 --> 00:52:30,290
Osman will be in our hands.

591
00:52:30,640 --> 00:52:32,850
So let's go and work this out.

592
00:52:33,600 --> 00:52:36,090
The loyal soldiers of Sultan Alaeddin...

593
00:52:36,330 --> 00:52:38,480
guard the corridors.

594
00:52:38,680 --> 00:52:39,820
Good.

595
00:52:40,750 --> 00:52:43,220
Olof will kill the soldiers for us.

596
00:52:43,590 --> 00:52:46,750
Everyone will think that
Osman killed them.

597
00:52:52,320 --> 00:52:53,640
Let's go.

598
00:53:01,190 --> 00:53:04,510
Everyone knows that we have
kidnapped Sultan Mesut.

599
00:53:04,960 --> 00:53:08,550
The verdict of the court is known, my Bey.

600
00:53:09,220 --> 00:53:12,820
I don't think that Sultan
Alaeddin's intention is good.

601
00:53:13,600 --> 00:53:17,350
Sultan Alaeddin wants to win
the trust of his followers.

602
00:53:17,500 --> 00:53:19,660
His only goal is this

603
00:53:19,760 --> 00:53:22,110
However, İsmihan will not allow this.

604
00:53:22,300 --> 00:53:25,470
Isn't her concern to put the
rope around our necks, my Bey?

605
00:53:26,390 --> 00:53:29,320
Is there a better
opportunity than this?

606
00:53:30,030 --> 00:53:33,080
No, she can't do such a thing.

607
00:53:33,900 --> 00:53:37,150
While there's still confidence in the
hearts of the people towards us...

608
00:53:37,170 --> 00:53:43,400
If she tries to do that, the people
will revolt when we go to court.

609
00:53:44,280 --> 00:53:46,590
İsmihan's goal is not this.

610
00:53:48,980 --> 00:53:53,940
She'll not judge us before she makes us
seem bad in front of people.

611
00:53:54,500 --> 00:53:58,710
Are you saying that they spread the
disease in Söğüt for this reason?

612
00:54:00,390 --> 00:54:02,630
She's such a vicious snake that...

613
00:54:05,070 --> 00:54:08,440
they do not hesitate to rise
up by killing innocent people.

614
00:54:09,580 --> 00:54:12,790
She fights me by
exploiting the lives of the people.

615
00:54:13,630 --> 00:54:15,530
What if we don't find the cure, my Bey?

616
00:54:15,740 --> 00:54:18,120
We'll find it.
Malhun.

617
00:54:18,490 --> 00:54:22,390
Malhun is there, she'll get over this
with Kumral Abdal.

618
00:54:22,820 --> 00:54:24,440
Don't ever worry.

619
00:54:25,100 --> 00:54:26,320
Inshallah.

620
00:54:30,960 --> 00:54:35,170
We listen to you, what do
you want, Malhun Hatun?

621
00:54:35,560 --> 00:54:39,240
I heard that you arrested Osman
Bey and Bala Hatun.

622
00:54:39,500 --> 00:54:41,410
They will be judged tomorrow.

623
00:54:41,410 --> 00:54:43,130
It's true what you heard.

624
00:54:44,190 --> 00:54:46,380
Your husband Osman is in dungeon.

625
00:54:49,660 --> 00:54:54,680
May I know why my husband Osman
is in the dungeon, my Sultan?

626
00:54:56,780 --> 00:54:58,990
She asks as if she doesn't know.

627
00:55:02,320 --> 00:55:04,600
You all united.

628
00:55:05,430 --> 00:55:07,900
And you did things behind Konya's back.

629
00:55:07,930 --> 00:55:11,210
I don't do anything
behind anyone's back, Mother Sultan.

630
00:55:11,360 --> 00:55:12,680
On the contrary...

631
00:55:13,340 --> 00:55:17,310
I do what I want and I
look into your eyes.

632
00:55:19,670 --> 00:55:23,770
Is that why you played a game with
Bala and you stole my seal?

633
00:55:24,590 --> 00:55:27,240
I don't know which seal
you are talking about.

634
00:55:28,070 --> 00:55:33,210
I came here to get information regarding
the trial of Osman Bey and Bala Hatun.

635
00:55:33,350 --> 00:55:38,240
Osman Bey has kidnapped my
Uncle Mesut, Malhun Hatun.

636
00:55:39,430 --> 00:55:42,760
You must know the
punishment for this very well.

637
00:55:45,440 --> 00:55:47,470
I certainly know, my Sultan.

638
00:55:48,990 --> 00:55:53,470
That's why, if you'll excuse
me, before the court...

639
00:55:53,620 --> 00:55:54,980
I want to see my husband.

640
00:55:55,100 --> 00:55:58,380
You can never see him, Malhun Hatun.

641
00:56:05,380 --> 00:56:07,030
Right, my Sultan?

642
00:56:08,680 --> 00:56:12,050
You know how dangerous Osman Bey is.

643
00:56:18,390 --> 00:56:20,330
My mother is right.

644
00:56:23,770 --> 00:56:26,340
You cannot see Osman Bey
until the court date.

645
00:56:29,410 --> 00:56:31,440
You heard what Sultan said.

646
00:56:31,750 --> 00:56:34,350
If we don't throw you
in the dungeon now...

647
00:56:35,060 --> 00:56:37,550
it's thanks to Sultan's mercy.

648
00:56:41,640 --> 00:56:45,630
You all got together and did it.

649
00:56:46,740 --> 00:56:49,980
And you are not innocent, Malhun Hatun.

650
00:56:50,570 --> 00:56:55,780
But I will not approach you
for the sake of your sons.

651
00:57:02,320 --> 00:57:03,400
Bala.

652
00:57:09,400 --> 00:57:12,550
As if it wasn't enough what you've
been through all these years...

653
00:57:12,590 --> 00:57:14,520
Now, you're in a dungeon.

654
00:57:16,970 --> 00:57:21,360
I've a husband who's being held captive in
order not to leave me alone in the dungeon.

655
00:57:23,610 --> 00:57:27,120
I'd suffer again for you, my Osman.

656
00:57:27,750 --> 00:57:29,550
May Allah bless you.

657
00:57:31,410 --> 00:57:32,560
Tell me.

658
00:57:33,900 --> 00:57:36,470
There was a flower I brought for you.

659
00:57:36,970 --> 00:57:38,840
It was purple-like.

660
00:57:39,610 --> 00:57:42,360
Do you remember it? What
was its name?

661
00:57:43,880 --> 00:57:48,610
Oh, yes. You used to bring
me flowers before, Osman Bey.

662
00:57:49,000 --> 00:57:52,510
You were so busy with the affairs of the
state and you didn't bring me again.

663
00:57:52,610 --> 00:57:55,300
Yes, yes, Bala.

664
00:57:56,080 --> 00:58:00,420
But it wasn't there all the time. I'd pick
it up and bring it to you when I found it.

665
00:58:00,500 --> 00:58:01,980
What was its name?

666
00:58:02,340 --> 00:58:05,000
You're talking about the flower of love.
(Centaurea tchihatcheffii)

667
00:58:05,060 --> 00:58:06,990
Yes, the flower of love.

668
00:58:07,810 --> 00:58:09,370
The flower of love.

669
00:58:12,340 --> 00:58:15,270
What are you going to do?
Will you bring it again?

670
00:58:20,030 --> 00:58:21,900
When we get out of here safely...

671
00:58:22,670 --> 00:58:26,600
we'll mount our horses and go to the place
where this flower is.

672
00:58:33,950 --> 00:58:37,580
We'll do anything to get out of here.

673
00:58:37,620 --> 00:58:39,750
We cannot leave Osman
Bey to them.

674
00:58:39,790 --> 00:58:41,560
How are we going
to do that, Subasi?

675
00:58:41,580 --> 00:58:43,280
We can't do anything.

676
00:58:51,190 --> 00:58:53,920
You have been standing since
morning, my brothers.

677
00:58:54,150 --> 00:58:56,990
There are many soldiers, what
are they doing?

678
00:58:57,620 --> 00:58:59,050
Are they hanging out?

679
00:58:59,810 --> 00:59:01,230
It is true what
you say, my brother.

680
00:59:30,700 --> 00:59:31,500
Let's go.

681
00:59:31,510 --> 00:59:32,640
What are you doing here?

682
00:59:32,710 --> 00:59:35,920
We have to go before
someone catches up with us.

683
00:59:36,830 --> 00:59:38,140
Hurry up!

684
00:59:40,870 --> 00:59:44,790
Thank you but we must help
the rest of the Alps.

685
00:59:44,820 --> 00:59:45,980
Your command, my Bey.

686
00:59:46,130 --> 00:59:48,050
We will save them all, Inshallah.

687
00:59:48,190 --> 00:59:49,200
Let's go.

688
01:00:34,240 --> 01:00:36,220
The yard was the easy part...

689
01:00:37,000 --> 01:00:39,770
but it looks like this place
is going to tire us.

690
01:00:40,020 --> 01:00:43,450
Brothers, be careful.

691
01:00:44,100 --> 01:00:47,030
We'll take my Bey and
get out of here alive.

692
01:00:47,070 --> 01:00:48,300
Inshallah.

693
01:00:50,100 --> 01:00:53,020
Take your positions, brothers, take
your positions.

694
01:00:58,200 --> 01:01:02,820
Boran Alp, we're
enough, we'll kill them all.

695
01:01:02,850 --> 01:01:04,850
Yes, we can, however...

696
01:01:04,890 --> 01:01:08,070
we make the whole castle
come to us, brother.

697
01:01:08,400 --> 01:01:10,800
Save your excitement for later.

698
01:01:11,000 --> 01:01:12,800
Let's take my Bey first.

699
01:01:15,420 --> 01:01:16,870
Brothers.

700
01:01:17,310 --> 01:01:19,560
We shouldn't wait anymore.

701
01:01:19,600 --> 01:01:21,600
They are coming.

702
01:01:39,900 --> 01:01:42,150
Aykut.

703
01:01:42,300 --> 01:01:44,300
My brother.

704
01:01:48,770 --> 01:01:49,870
Brothers.

705
01:01:49,920 --> 01:01:51,650
We won't leave them around, come on.

706
01:02:03,450 --> 01:02:07,720
They are coming, more are coming.
Come on, brothers. Come on.

707
01:02:07,770 --> 01:02:09,770
Aykut, come on!

708
01:02:13,270 --> 01:02:15,220
Are you saying we're
going out, my Bey?

709
01:02:15,970 --> 01:02:18,760
We'll go out, we'll definitely go out.

710
01:02:18,790 --> 01:02:21,650
We've been through a lot, this won't
defeat us, my dear Bala.

711
01:02:21,670 --> 01:02:23,250
We are definitely prisoners now.

712
01:02:23,750 --> 01:02:26,100
But we will be free, don't worry.

713
01:02:27,820 --> 01:02:29,900
It won't be that easy.

714
01:02:31,920 --> 01:02:33,930
We will race.

715
01:02:34,120 --> 01:02:36,980
And the winner will bring
a gift to the other.

716
01:02:37,620 --> 01:02:40,570
Aren't the flowers enough for you?
And you want a gift?

717
01:02:41,670 --> 01:02:45,750
Good, it's good that you already know
that you will lose, Osman Bey.

718
01:02:47,470 --> 01:02:52,350
Bala, the boys are growing up, and
meanwhile, Alaca is getting old.

719
01:02:53,120 --> 01:02:55,800
In my opinion, don't trust it too much.

720
01:02:57,650 --> 01:03:01,720
My Alaca defeats your horse
even when it's old.

721
01:03:02,450 --> 01:03:03,600
Is that what you say?

722
01:03:05,020 --> 01:03:06,600
Never worry.

723
01:03:06,630 --> 01:03:08,630
I'll take that gift.

724
01:03:09,250 --> 01:03:10,600
We'll see.

725
01:03:26,250 --> 01:03:29,120
What are you doing here, ignoble?

726
01:03:35,820 --> 01:03:38,800
Excuse me, but the only gift you
will receive today...

727
01:03:44,400 --> 01:03:45,870
is death.

728
01:04:07,350 --> 01:04:11,900
Enough, I don't want to shed more
brother's blood, Cerkutay.

729
01:04:12,050 --> 01:04:15,170
There is nothing we can do, brother.

730
01:04:27,970 --> 01:04:30,250
Boran.
Cerkutay.

731
01:04:32,970 --> 01:04:34,120
Aktemur Bey.

732
01:04:35,890 --> 01:04:36,720
Osman Bey.

733
01:04:36,750 --> 01:04:38,750
This way!

734
01:04:40,270 --> 01:04:42,040
Come on, brothers, come on.

735
01:04:42,070 --> 01:04:44,920
Come on, let's catch up
with my Bey, come on.

736
01:04:45,920 --> 01:04:47,300
Alçiçek.

737
01:04:47,670 --> 01:04:50,470
Hold on,
we'll do the rest.

738
01:04:53,120 --> 01:04:54,470
Thank you.

739
01:04:58,270 --> 01:05:00,730
- Take her.
- What are you saying?

740
01:05:00,800 --> 01:05:02,710
No.
No.

741
01:05:02,800 --> 01:05:04,510
Your problem is with me.

742
01:05:04,570 --> 01:05:06,420
Calm down, Osman Bey.

743
01:05:06,450 --> 01:05:08,450
Your wife is your bond.

744
01:05:08,750 --> 01:05:12,820
- Don't touch me, put your hand away.
- Bala, Bala!

745
01:05:12,910 --> 01:05:16,370
Put your hand away, put it away.

746
01:05:17,900 --> 01:05:20,100
Bala.

747
01:05:26,300 --> 01:05:31,020
You, you... open the dungeon!

748
01:05:31,180 --> 01:05:32,300
Open.

749
01:05:32,520 --> 01:05:34,300
Come on, come over here.

750
01:05:34,360 --> 01:05:36,150
Leave her alone! Bala!

751
01:05:36,190 --> 01:05:38,190
Bala! Bala!

752
01:05:39,100 --> 01:05:40,020
Open.

753
01:05:41,620 --> 01:05:43,900
And now, you will stand quietly, Osman Bey

754
01:05:46,450 --> 01:05:49,050
We'll get out of here together quietly.

755
01:05:50,920 --> 01:05:52,420
Otherwise..

756
01:05:59,300 --> 01:06:01,020
You... you...

757
01:06:04,120 --> 01:06:05,850
Release me now.

758
01:06:20,520 --> 01:06:24,420
Your end is coming.
You are...

759
01:06:24,700 --> 01:06:26,420
You are...

760
01:06:27,620 --> 01:06:32,970
Bala, don't worry. We'll ride
our horses to the places I mentioned.

761
01:06:32,970 --> 01:06:35,970
- We'll ride.
- Yeah, we'll ride.

762
01:06:35,970 --> 01:06:37,970
We will ride.

763
01:06:45,570 --> 01:06:46,920
The corridor is clear.

764
01:06:51,470 --> 01:06:54,370
And the wolf fell into our hands, right?

765
01:06:54,370 --> 01:06:57,970
The day this wolf
will tear you apart is coming.

766
01:06:57,970 --> 01:06:59,970
There is no such day, Osman.

767
01:07:00,520 --> 01:07:01,970
Today is your last day.

768
01:07:07,750 --> 01:07:10,900
You killed all those soldiers of Sultan
and ran away.

769
01:07:11,750 --> 01:07:16,520
You will be remembered as a traitor
after you die.

770
01:07:21,050 --> 01:07:22,120
Osman!

771
01:07:23,050 --> 01:07:24,970
Osman! Osman!

772
01:07:24,970 --> 01:07:26,470
Osman!

773
01:07:26,470 --> 01:07:28,470
- My Osman!
- Shut up!

774
01:07:39,150 --> 01:07:41,000
Bring the chests.

775
01:08:32,370 --> 01:08:34,999
My Bey! My Bey!

776
01:08:43,720 --> 01:08:45,100
There is no one here.

777
01:08:45,899 --> 01:08:48,999
Aykurt, are you sure this is the place,
brother? There is nobody here.

778
01:08:48,999 --> 01:08:50,999
This is the place, brother!

779
01:08:51,800 --> 01:08:54,050
Someone is coming.

780
01:09:06,370 --> 01:09:07,499
You...

781
01:09:09,200 --> 01:09:11,200
Why are you never following the orders?

782
01:09:11,200 --> 01:09:12,970
They were after you.

783
01:09:14,970 --> 01:09:16,669
There is something wrong.

784
01:09:17,370 --> 01:09:18,669
They were here.

785
01:09:18,669 --> 01:09:20,550
They were here but now there is no one!

786
01:09:20,550 --> 01:09:22,020
What do we do now?

787
01:09:22,020 --> 01:09:24,020
How do we find our Bey?

788
01:09:28,010 --> 01:09:30,100
Yenişehir
Palace of Osman Bey!

789
01:09:32,870 --> 01:09:35,100
Alps! Sisters!

790
01:09:35,370 --> 01:09:37,819
The future of our community
is in our hands.

791
01:09:38,350 --> 01:09:41,669
We're not getting out of here
until we find a trace

792
01:09:41,669 --> 01:09:43,669
Come on, search everywhere!

793
01:09:43,870 --> 01:09:45,669
Search everywhere!

794
01:09:58,120 --> 01:10:01,350
Look here, lift this, lift it.

795
01:10:04,600 --> 01:10:07,120
It smells very bad in here, Kumral Abdal.

796
01:10:12,450 --> 01:10:14,750
Take it out, come on.

797
01:10:26,070 --> 01:10:28,370
Allah damn this!

798
01:10:28,370 --> 01:10:30,520
What is this? What is this smell?

799
01:10:30,520 --> 01:10:31,620
Don't touch it.

800
01:10:32,400 --> 01:10:35,720
Go away, go away.

801
01:11:06,420 --> 01:11:07,820
This is poison.

802
01:11:09,900 --> 01:11:11,920
So it was confirmed.

803
01:11:11,920 --> 01:11:13,920
They are the ones who have poison.

804
01:11:15,270 --> 01:11:17,320
If they have poison...

805
01:11:17,320 --> 01:11:19,320
...they must also have an antidote.

806
01:11:20,270 --> 01:11:22,670
Why do they do something like this?

807
01:11:22,920 --> 01:11:27,350
Isn't it clear? Ismahan will distribute
the antidote to the people herself.

808
01:11:27,620 --> 01:11:30,770
And she will become a hero
in the eyes of the people.

809
01:11:30,770 --> 01:11:35,250
Then we'll find the antidote
before they do.

810
01:11:35,950 --> 01:11:38,050
But how?

811
01:11:38,050 --> 01:11:40,520
We have to find a way to get Martha.

812
01:11:44,320 --> 01:11:47,620
Kumral Abdal, tell us.

813
01:11:50,420 --> 01:11:52,120
If this is what I think it is...

814
01:11:53,600 --> 01:11:55,120
...I've found the antidote.

815
01:11:57,650 --> 01:12:00,020
Oh...
Thank Allah!

816
01:12:00,020 --> 01:12:02,020
Come on, come on,
we are getting out!

817
01:12:02,370 --> 01:12:04,020
Let's go!

818
01:12:29,170 --> 01:12:30,400
They escaped!

819
01:12:30,520 --> 01:12:31,660
How could this happen?

820
01:12:31,660 --> 01:12:33,430
What were all of our soldiers doing?

821
01:12:33,430 --> 01:12:36,500
I told you!
I said Osman would escape!

822
01:12:36,500 --> 01:12:37,020
Soldiers!

823
01:12:37,020 --> 01:12:39,020
Shut up, Bayindir.

824
01:12:39,250 --> 01:12:40,450
Shut up.

825
01:12:41,700 --> 01:12:43,620
What shall we do now, Mother Sultan?

826
01:12:43,620 --> 01:12:45,840
They can't make it out of the castle.
Let's...

827
01:12:45,840 --> 01:12:47,620
They didn't run away.

828
01:12:49,300 --> 01:12:50,800
They were kidnapped.

829
01:12:53,450 --> 01:12:55,030
Kantakouzanos kidnapped them.

830
01:12:56,370 --> 01:13:00,870
However, only we will be aware of this.

831
01:13:03,750 --> 01:13:10,520
Everyone, including Sultan Alaeddin,
will think that Osman and Bala have escaped.

832
01:13:11,820 --> 01:13:14,450
Wow, wow, wow.

833
01:13:18,250 --> 01:13:21,020
But no one will know about this.

834
01:13:21,500 --> 01:13:23,020
Did you hear me well?

835
01:13:23,300 --> 01:13:24,670
Yes

836
01:13:25,870 --> 01:13:32,550
Tomorrow, when the sun rises, we'll inform
everyone that Osman and Bala escaped.

837
01:13:39,170 --> 01:13:40,520
Sogut.

838
01:13:41,770 --> 01:13:44,220
Did they torture you a lot in the dungeon?

839
01:13:44,320 --> 01:13:45,220
And my mother?

840
01:13:46,300 --> 01:13:48,320
Did they hurt my mother?

841
01:13:49,900 --> 01:13:51,470
Yes, she was hurt.

842
01:13:52,150 --> 01:13:55,370
But every human gets hurt once in a while.

843
01:13:55,370 --> 01:13:58,300
We will all be hurt, Aladdin.

844
01:13:59,600 --> 01:14:02,800
But this pain will enhance us.

845
01:14:12,170 --> 01:14:13,270
My sheikh.

846
01:14:15,220 --> 01:14:17,770
Where are my mother and father?

847
01:14:21,400 --> 01:14:23,470
They are not here, son.

848
01:14:28,400 --> 01:14:31,470
Ismihan must have another plan.

849
01:14:32,820 --> 01:14:34,470
They were not in the dungeon.

850
01:14:37,050 --> 01:14:38,870
But don't worry.

851
01:14:38,870 --> 01:14:42,120
We will find my Bey and Bala eventually.

852
01:14:44,600 --> 01:14:46,170
Have a seat.

853
01:14:52,250 --> 01:14:54,100
My princes!

854
01:14:55,600 --> 01:15:01,370
Your mother and father are captured by
the infidels for their cause.

855
01:15:02,500 --> 01:15:07,505
How fortunate you are that
you are the children of...

856
01:15:07,505 --> 01:15:13,785
...a brave mother and father who suffer
for the call of the Messenger of Allah

857
01:15:13,785 --> 01:15:16,385
They are attacking us from
every side, my sheikh grandfather.

858
01:15:16,385 --> 01:15:18,520
We kept ignoring the pain in our hearts...

859
01:15:18,520 --> 01:15:21,110
... as we were always concerned
about our community.

860
01:15:21,110 --> 01:15:22,000
However...

861
01:15:22,630 --> 01:15:25,340
this is becoming harder and harder,
my sheikh grandfather.

862
01:15:25,340 --> 01:15:27,020
Fatima keeps asking.

863
01:15:28,520 --> 01:15:31,420
I can't say anything to her.
Halime.

864
01:15:32,920 --> 01:15:35,620
I'm big and I'm used to this, but...

865
01:15:36,650 --> 01:15:38,670
Halima needs my mother's scent.

866
01:15:45,470 --> 01:15:50,550
Oh my princes, you know
the Battle of Uhud, right?

867
01:15:51,700 --> 01:15:53,820
Do you remember what happened in that war?

868
01:15:53,820 --> 01:15:59,300
The army of the Messenger of Allah
was defeated at Uhud.

869
01:15:59,300 --> 01:16:02,600
We had many martyrs.

870
01:16:02,600 --> 01:16:11,520
Even his uncle, the lion of Allah,
Hadrat Hamza, was martyred.

871
01:16:11,550 --> 01:16:14,300
The Messenger of Allah
and his army grieved greatly.

872
01:16:15,270 --> 01:16:21,870
And do you know what is the verse
that Allah sent down after that?

873
01:16:23,600 --> 01:16:28,420
He said in Surat Al-Imran verse 139:

874
01:16:29,400 --> 01:16:39,620
Do not weaken and do not grieve, and you
will be superior if you are [true] believers.

875
01:16:43,500 --> 01:16:50,050
Now, let Ismihan think that
she has defeated us with her tricks.

876
01:16:51,020 --> 01:16:54,300
But we are true believers.

877
01:16:54,300 --> 01:16:57,020
We dedicated our hearts to Allah.

878
01:16:57,850 --> 01:17:00,150
We know we will definitely win.

879
01:17:02,400 --> 01:17:09,950
And we continue to fight for Allah
wholeheartedly without falling into despair

880
01:17:10,670 --> 01:17:12,270
Of course, my sheikh.

881
01:17:12,500 --> 01:17:14,520
Of course, my sheikh grandfather.

882
01:17:15,100 --> 01:17:16,550
And now, children...

883
01:17:18,320 --> 01:17:23,450
You are the ones who will run the campaign
that will change everything.

884
01:17:23,450 --> 01:17:25,450
Turgut Bey will be with you too.

885
01:17:26,870 --> 01:17:28,350
How, my sheikh?

886
01:17:28,770 --> 01:17:35,650
Our Shahzadas (princes)will save
Masoud before Ismihan kills him.

887
01:17:36,350 --> 01:17:41,270
Orhan Bey, Aladdin Bey.

888
01:17:41,950 --> 01:17:43,970
The field is now yours.

889
01:17:44,220 --> 01:17:48,170
We will find Osman Bey and Bala Hatun.

890
01:17:49,270 --> 01:17:52,520
And you will save Sultan Mesut.

891
01:17:53,720 --> 01:17:56,270
- Of course, mother.
- Of course, mother.

892
01:18:19,180 --> 01:18:20,480
Bala.

893
01:18:25,110 --> 01:18:26,920
Bala.

894
01:18:37,960 --> 01:18:40,960
Bala! Bala!

895
01:18:42,940 --> 01:18:46,340
- My Osman!
- Are you okay?

896
01:18:47,480 --> 01:18:50,080
I'm good. Are you fine?

897
01:18:55,050 --> 01:19:01,820
Ignobles! Dogs!
They tied us up.

898
01:19:09,720 --> 01:19:12,100
Don't try in vain, Osman.

899
01:19:12,880 --> 01:19:15,780
Your strength is not enough for everything.

900
01:19:19,510 --> 01:19:22,590
There is only one way to
get out of here, Osman.

901
01:19:24,950 --> 01:19:28,220
Just tell us where the crucifix is.

902
01:19:28,410 --> 01:19:30,680
So everything was for this, huh?

903
01:19:30,680 --> 01:19:35,310
What did you think? Did you think I would
get you out of the court and set you free?

904
01:19:35,800 --> 01:19:38,960
Tell me where the crucifix is
and I'll let you live.

905
01:19:40,770 --> 01:19:43,690
Are you threatening me with death?

906
01:19:44,150 --> 01:19:45,480
No.

907
01:19:45,700 --> 01:19:51,270
That's why your wife is here with us.
I am threatening you with her life.

908
01:19:52,920 --> 01:19:58,090
You delivered even Sultan Mesut for her.

909
01:19:58,410 --> 01:20:05,070
You abandoned your dreams of
being a state just for her.

910
01:20:09,660 --> 01:20:13,290
What about Andranikos and the throne?

911
01:20:14,560 --> 01:20:19,920
You a man who wants to interfere with
the states nearby and empower yourself.

912
01:20:20,270 --> 01:20:23,260
If you would have allowed me to
sit on the throne that day...

913
01:20:23,260 --> 01:20:25,810
...we would't have to do that today.

914
01:20:27,250 --> 01:20:31,090
I knew you were behind those bloody plans.

915
01:20:31,250 --> 01:20:34,200
- But...
- Shut up, that's enough

916
01:20:34,420 --> 01:20:37,910
I don't want to hear anything
but the location of the crucifix.

917
01:20:39,640 --> 01:20:43,910
Either you say it
or bid farewell to your Bala.

918
01:20:47,750 --> 01:20:51,110
Say nothing, my Osman.

919
01:20:51,600 --> 01:20:54,000
We'll meet in the afterlife.

920
01:20:54,170 --> 01:20:58,170
Don't say anything that
will give these ignobles power.

921
01:20:58,710 --> 01:21:02,150
Have you heard?

922
01:21:02,310 --> 01:21:04,310
Tell me.

923
01:21:04,470 --> 01:21:10,370
Just as we are not afraid of death, we are
not afraid of each other's death either.

924
01:21:12,990 --> 01:21:17,620
Death is a short amount of separation.

925
01:21:18,030 --> 01:21:20,540
The meeting will be in the afterlife.

926
01:21:25,280 --> 01:21:27,740
If you kill me...

927
01:21:29,230 --> 01:21:32,090
...you will not get any information.

928
01:21:32,770 --> 01:21:38,230
But if you kill my Hatun,
you get nothing.

929
01:21:39,560 --> 01:21:46,000
You're smart enough not to do this
I know you well.

930
01:21:52,270 --> 01:21:56,010
Do you know me Osman?

931
01:21:56,710 --> 01:21:58,820
Do you know me?

932
01:22:05,800 --> 01:22:07,480
You!

933
01:22:07,610 --> 01:22:12,730
I can kill Bala for fun.

934
01:22:13,700 --> 01:22:15,270
Martha.

935
01:22:16,110 --> 01:22:19,270
It was you, you devil!

936
01:22:20,540 --> 01:22:23,300
I'm Marta.

937
01:22:24,930 --> 01:22:27,930
I'm Frig.

938
01:22:29,630 --> 01:22:35,020
I will kill you now Bala.

939
01:22:38,610 --> 01:22:41,750
Bala, leave her

940
01:22:46,970 --> 01:22:49,790
Bala!
Bala!

941
01:22:53,250 --> 01:22:55,310
What are you doing, Frigg?

942
01:22:55,410 --> 01:23:03,960
I don't care about that cross or anything!
I don't obey, Kantakuzenos!

943
01:23:04,480 --> 01:23:08,050
And I can't calm down, Olof!

944
01:23:08,210 --> 01:23:09,100
Let me go.

945
01:23:17,330 --> 01:23:18,200
Frig.

946
01:23:20,250 --> 01:23:21,480
Calm down.

947
01:23:27,690 --> 01:23:30,420
I may stop for my darling.

948
01:23:31,880 --> 01:23:34,800
Bala!
My Bala!

949
01:23:35,210 --> 01:23:37,670
But Osman...

950
01:23:38,400 --> 01:23:40,050
...hurry up.

951
01:23:40,210 --> 01:23:41,670
Speak.

952
01:23:42,000 --> 01:23:47,220
Otherwise, I will not control myself.

953
01:23:47,270 --> 01:23:50,840
- I crave blood
- You vile!

954
01:23:51,740 --> 01:23:52,950
No.

955
01:23:53,120 --> 01:23:56,090
Your beloved partner is dying, Osman.

956
01:23:58,820 --> 01:24:02,020
I will take your wounded deer from you.

957
01:24:04,420 --> 01:24:07,290
This is your last chance.

958
01:24:11,970 --> 01:24:13,400
Its enough!

959
01:24:17,270 --> 01:24:23,170
You took my brothers, my soldiers and
everything I had!

960
01:24:24,500 --> 01:24:26,250
Saga!

961
01:24:27,230 --> 01:24:28,610
Eric!

962
01:24:29,720 --> 01:24:31,500
Uf!

963
01:24:34,370 --> 01:24:36,020
Osman!

964
01:24:47,790 --> 01:24:55,710
Speak up, I will kill you
if you don't speak up.

965
01:24:56,010 --> 01:24:58,880
- Speak
. - That's enough, Olof!

966
01:24:59,010 --> 01:25:01,210
If he dies, we won't get any information.

967
01:25:06,050 --> 01:25:07,860
Osman.

968
01:25:11,840 --> 01:25:15,250
Speak Osman, speak!

969
01:25:20,820 --> 01:25:23,980
Marmaracik Castle

970
01:25:33,670 --> 01:25:37,160
What kind of guards are you?

971
01:25:37,290 --> 01:25:39,320
How could Osman escape?

972
01:25:43,330 --> 01:25:47,570
Send soldiers to search!
Find that rebel!

973
01:25:54,420 --> 01:25:56,470
Mother Sultan.

974
01:25:57,120 --> 01:26:00,230
Aktemur is absent too.

975
01:26:00,370 --> 01:26:03,400
- Alps escaped.
- How did this happen?

976
01:26:04,830 --> 01:26:09,670
Find out who did this, Bengi Hatun.

977
01:26:18,490 --> 01:26:22,250
Attention, Sultan Aladdin!

978
01:26:24,770 --> 01:26:26,800
What happened here?

979
01:26:28,290 --> 01:26:33,240
Osman escaped with his alps, my Sultan.

980
01:26:33,860 --> 01:26:40,030
Knowing his punishment, he escaped
in order not to be brought to court.

981
01:26:52,360 --> 01:26:54,610
Why are you standing here?

982
01:26:54,800 --> 01:26:57,720
Find him and cut his head immediately!

983
01:27:01,130 --> 01:27:10,000
Your Honor, by doing this, Osman admitted
his guilt and run away from the court.

984
01:27:10,190 --> 01:27:12,600
From now on he is a rebel.

985
01:27:12,900 --> 01:27:16,950
That is why we must take over Yenişehir!

986
01:27:27,600 --> 01:27:30,370
Speak, Osman, speak!

987
01:28:00,590 --> 01:28:04,130
I'll talk, I'll talk.

988
01:28:04,670 --> 01:28:06,730
I will talk.

989
01:28:08,290 --> 01:28:13,300
There is a shepherd in the forest
near Uzundere.

990
01:28:17,030 --> 01:28:21,900
He is from Ahis.
He has a secret sentence.

991
01:28:22,080 --> 01:28:23,580
What is his sentence?

992
01:28:25,830 --> 01:28:30,910
"A herb is not without smoke,
nor is a valiant without a sword...

993
01:28:30,910 --> 01:28:32,590
...Osman Bey sent me...

994
01:28:33,470 --> 01:28:37,760
...the knife does not sharpen its handle"
You will tell this exactly like I said.

995
01:28:37,760 --> 01:28:39,200
Nice.

996
01:28:40,870 --> 01:28:43,400
Osman and Bala are yours.

997
01:28:47,020 --> 01:28:50,550
You can kill them however you like.
We are leaving.

998
01:29:10,750 --> 01:29:14,780
We sent alps to all the places my Bey can
be taken. They're all looking for a trace.

999
01:29:14,780 --> 01:29:16,460
We don't have much time, Aktemur.

1000
01:29:16,460 --> 01:29:18,460
We will also go and participate
in the search.

1001
01:29:21,950 --> 01:29:27,580
Malhun Hatun, Mother Sultan,
she is coming with her soldiers.

1002
01:29:29,680 --> 01:29:32,720
There is news from the shepherd,
it's time.

1003
01:29:35,190 --> 01:29:37,080
You get out on the road quickly.

1004
01:29:37,460 --> 01:29:39,670
She will suspect it if she doesn't see me.

1005
01:29:39,670 --> 01:29:42,580
Let me know what she wants first.

1006
01:29:42,580 --> 01:29:45,820
I'll catch up with you after that.
Send me news.

1007
01:29:55,630 --> 01:29:57,670
Come and see, Mother Sultan.

1008
01:29:58,760 --> 01:30:02,100
Let us understand what your problem is.

1009
01:30:02,100 --> 01:30:05,180
Attention, Mother Sultan!

1010
01:30:31,150 --> 01:30:35,350
Malhun Hatun,
I wasn't expecting to see you here.

1011
01:30:48,060 --> 01:30:52,280
Darling, we've waited so long
for this day, haven't we?

1012
01:30:52,780 --> 01:30:55,620
We get what we wait for eventually.

1013
01:30:56,440 --> 01:30:59,120
We'll end Osman and Bala.

1014
01:30:59,980 --> 01:31:04,140
Lord allowed us to do that.

1015
01:31:09,790 --> 01:31:12,310
We also pray to our Creator.

1016
01:31:13,550 --> 01:31:16,420
Our Creator accepts our prayers as well.

1017
01:31:16,590 --> 01:31:20,020
The prayers of the infidels
will not be accepted, Osman.

1018
01:31:22,980 --> 01:31:28,590
They should fight for Jesus.

1019
01:31:35,920 --> 01:31:39,910
Olof, will we kill
Bala in front of Osman?

1020
01:31:41,020 --> 01:31:42,960
Or kill Osman in front of Bala?

1021
01:31:47,470 --> 01:31:53,240
I will kill Osman,
and you'll kill her slowly.

1022
01:31:53,240 --> 01:31:55,750
I'm not that patient.

1023
01:31:57,380 --> 01:31:59,430
We will meet in the afterlife.

1024
01:32:01,060 --> 01:32:06,660
But before that, we 'll ride our horses
to those flowers first. Don'tworry.

1025
01:32:07,310 --> 01:32:08,660
I do not worry.

1026
01:32:15,100 --> 01:32:16,540
Come on.

1027
01:32:26,270 --> 01:32:29,200
This is finally a fair fight now.

1028
01:32:47,380 --> 01:32:48,560
Osman!

1029
01:33:12,240 --> 01:33:13,800
Bala, come on.

1030
01:33:14,620 --> 01:33:16,740
- Come on, quickly.
- Come on, come on.

1031
01:33:16,740 --> 01:33:18,870
Let's go! Let's go!

1032
01:33:26,750 --> 01:33:28,060
Frig!

1033
01:33:31,630 --> 01:33:34,920
Frig! Frig!

1034
01:33:36,690 --> 01:33:37,510
Get up.

1035
01:33:40,580 --> 01:33:41,480
Come.

1036
01:33:53,190 --> 01:33:55,320
Your time is over, Masut.

1037
01:33:56,300 --> 01:33:59,600
You will pay for the your betrayal now.

1038
01:34:00,760 --> 01:34:05,260
Allah is the only one who
knows who dies.

1039
01:34:13,430 --> 01:34:14,800
What are you waiting for?

1040
01:34:16,510 --> 01:34:22,670
Either you do that
or your heads will be cut with his.

1041
01:34:23,870 --> 01:34:27,540
Executioner, do your job!

1042
01:34:32,180 --> 01:34:35,770
I bear witness that there
is no god but Allah,

1043
01:34:35,770 --> 01:34:40,580
and I bear witness that Muhammad is
His servant and Messenger

1044
01:34:57,470 --> 01:35:00,420
- Oh right!
- Oh right!

1045
01:35:05,720 --> 01:35:08,110
We are here, Hadrat Sultan!

1046
01:36:10,470 --> 01:36:14,870
Sultan Mesut, you are fine, right?
I hope you're not injured.

1047
01:36:16,120 --> 01:36:21,310
You came just in time.
I owe you my life again.

1048
01:36:21,550 --> 01:36:24,030
No problem, Hadrat Sultan.

1049
01:36:24,030 --> 01:36:27,590
No problem, but it's not safe here.

1050
01:36:27,590 --> 01:36:30,090
They'll come after you when
they hear you're not dead.

1051
01:36:30,090 --> 01:36:31,920
We have to leave here
as soon as possible

1052
01:36:31,920 --> 01:36:32,630
Okay.

1053
01:36:32,630 --> 01:36:33,520
Let's go.

1054
01:36:43,820 --> 01:36:46,260
Bala, Bala, Bala!

1055
01:36:49,550 --> 01:36:52,030
Come on, come on, hold on.

1056
01:36:52,670 --> 01:36:55,280
This way, come on, let's go.
This way.

1057
01:36:55,280 --> 01:36:57,910
This way, let's go.
This way.

1058
01:37:14,400 --> 01:37:17,880
You go there and we go there.

1059
01:37:23,120 --> 01:37:25,260
- Stop here.
- I can make it, Osman.

1060
01:37:25,260 --> 01:37:27,780
No no no, we have to stop.

1061
01:37:27,780 --> 01:37:29,710
- We have to stop, Bala.
- No, Osman.

1062
01:37:29,710 --> 01:37:32,780
No no no, we should go on.
I am fine.

1063
01:37:32,780 --> 01:37:33,740
Bala!

1064
01:37:35,640 --> 01:37:36,640
We'll stop.

1065
01:37:36,640 --> 01:37:39,980
Stop here, come on, let's stop here.

1066
01:37:39,980 --> 01:37:42,540
Sit here, Bala.

1067
01:37:42,540 --> 01:37:45,320
Sit here.
Bala.

1068
01:37:51,440 --> 01:37:52,980
Open your wound.

1069
01:37:53,720 --> 01:37:55,310
I am fine Osman.

1070
01:37:55,310 --> 01:37:57,440
- I'm fine.
- You're fine, fine.

1071
01:37:57,440 --> 01:38:02,700
You do not show your pain
even if you are in pain, do I not know you?

1072
01:38:06,460 --> 01:38:08,720
You will hold on, Bala.

1073
01:38:09,300 --> 01:38:10,720
Hold on.

1074
01:38:16,630 --> 01:38:18,820
They're coming, come on
get up, walk

1075
01:38:18,820 --> 01:38:21,380
Go, go, go!

1076
01:38:37,210 --> 01:38:40,080
They shoot arrows, Bala, watch out.

1077
01:38:48,840 --> 01:38:51,730
Come, come.
Let's go.

1078
01:38:52,610 --> 01:38:54,050
Bala!

1079
01:38:54,950 --> 01:38:56,700
- Come! Come!
- Osman!

1080
01:38:56,710 --> 01:38:58,600
Come, let's go!

1081
01:39:04,140 --> 01:39:05,960
Where is your runaway husband?

1082
01:39:06,650 --> 01:39:09,050
I should be the one who is asking,
Mother Sultan.

1083
01:39:09,170 --> 01:39:11,080
Aren't you the one who
captured my Bey?

1084
01:39:11,460 --> 01:39:13,470
You should know where he is.

1085
01:39:15,250 --> 01:39:19,000
Let's cut to the chase now.
Why are you here?

1086
01:39:20,070 --> 01:39:23,510
I will not take your permission to come
to my land.

1087
01:39:25,910 --> 01:39:28,370
I don't know if Malhun Hatun
told you or not.

1088
01:39:29,180 --> 01:39:31,820
Now, hear me out.

1089
01:39:33,050 --> 01:39:37,130
Your Osman Bey wanted to
dethrone Sultan Aladdin...

1090
01:39:37,130 --> 01:39:39,830
...and enthrone Mesut.

1091
01:39:42,160 --> 01:39:46,090
But he did not succeed.
He got arrested.

1092
01:39:49,320 --> 01:39:51,160
And now he's a runaway.

1093
01:39:51,600 --> 01:39:57,940
This is Osman. He proved how rebel he is.
He escaped the court again.

1094
01:40:02,020 --> 01:40:03,910
He is now a rebel.

1095
01:40:06,780 --> 01:40:09,110
He has no sovereignty over you.

1096
01:40:10,020 --> 01:40:13,700
When you see him,
you must tell the soldiers.

1097
01:40:18,360 --> 01:40:22,840
Let's talk about why I am here now.

1098
01:40:24,550 --> 01:40:28,830
You will collect your belongings
and leave Yenişehir.

1099
01:40:30,740 --> 01:40:34,200
Who are you banishing
from these lands, Hatun?

1100
01:40:37,380 --> 01:40:41,090
I think you couldn't hear me, Malhun Hatun.

1101
01:40:41,700 --> 01:40:44,850
Your Bey is a rebel.
He is a rebel.

1102
01:40:46,980 --> 01:40:48,460
A runaway.

1103
01:40:50,190 --> 01:40:52,770
What lands are you talking about?

1104
01:40:58,250 --> 01:41:01,090
You can't get us out of here.

1105
01:41:02,690 --> 01:41:05,020
Draw that sword.
Draw it and I will...

1106
01:41:05,680 --> 01:41:13,030
...make you rot in that dungeon. I will
make everyone here rot, including babies.

1107
01:41:15,700 --> 01:41:19,490
You are acting unfairly, Ismihan Sultan.
We got these lands at the cost of our bloo...

1108
01:41:19,510 --> 01:41:22,470
I am not taking your tribe form you.
That's enough for you.

1109
01:41:25,600 --> 01:41:28,870
You will return to where you came from.

1110
01:41:31,110 --> 01:41:36,060
I don't want to see anyone in this palace
after sunset

1111
01:41:58,570 --> 01:42:00,470
Bala, come on.

1112
01:42:05,330 --> 01:42:08,240
Hold on, my dear Bala! Hold on!

1113
01:42:09,210 --> 01:42:13,990
They are coming.
Come on Bala, you have to hold on.

1114
01:42:19,310 --> 01:42:20,390
Bala.

1115
01:42:34,260 --> 01:42:41,270
Osman!
I will burn you and your people alive!

1116
01:42:41,390 --> 01:42:43,210
Your end will be the same.

1117
01:42:43,480 --> 01:42:45,860
Your fire will eventually
turn you into ashes!

1118
01:42:45,940 --> 01:42:47,130
Come to me.

1119
01:42:59,710 --> 01:43:02,290
I will separate your head from your body

1120
01:43:02,470 --> 01:43:04,610
Your tongue is as insolent as your sword

1121
01:43:05,240 --> 01:43:07,640
Come see

1122
01:43:36,830 --> 01:43:38,200
Top

1123
01:43:53,040 --> 01:43:54,100
frig

1124
01:44:00,750 --> 01:44:02,630
come on bala; They are coming

1125
01:44:02,680 --> 01:44:05,100
- I'm fine
- Come on, Siri! Let's go

1126
01:44:09,800 --> 01:44:11,660
- Are you well?
- okay

1127
01:44:12,230 --> 01:44:13,960
Come on, hurry up

1128
01:44:17,370 --> 01:44:18,720
Let's go

1129
01:44:30,210 --> 01:44:32,830
stop here; In order not to scare this shepherd

1130
01:45:04,020 --> 01:45:06,880
Peace be upon you, dear pastor

1131
01:45:10,730 --> 01:45:14,720
Peace be upon you, you
are welcome

1132
01:45:16,000 --> 01:45:19,300
- You prefer all of my food
- Thank you

1133
01:45:20,280 --> 01:45:24,460
- I came here to take a trust
- Then I hear you

1134
01:45:33,110 --> 01:45:38,470
"A herb is not without smoke,
nor is a valiant without a sword...

1135
01:45:39,580 --> 01:45:41,600
...Osman Bey sent me...

1136
01:45:42,810 --> 01:45:45,170
...the knife does not sharpen its handle"

1137
01:45:45,270 --> 01:45:48,990
Hmm, you want the secret.

1138
01:45:49,150 --> 01:45:51,750
I carry this heavy load
by my side every single day.

1139
01:45:53,210 --> 01:45:55,990
But you are not dressed like
our people.

1140
01:45:56,440 --> 01:45:57,660
Who are you?

1141
01:45:58,230 --> 01:46:01,020
I am Osman Bey's Alp in Constantinople.

1142
01:46:01,390 --> 01:46:04,020
Do not let my clothes misguide you.
I am one of you.

1143
01:46:04,040 --> 01:46:08,290
My Bey does such tricks, yeah.
Wait.

1144
01:46:22,340 --> 01:46:25,540
- What is it?
- I am not carrying it.

1145
01:46:26,880 --> 01:46:29,030
I just know where it is.

1146
01:46:29,950 --> 01:46:33,200
It is a very heavy one.

1147
01:46:34,360 --> 01:46:37,110
Come with me, brother spy.

1148
01:47:01,710 --> 01:47:04,400
My Bala, my Bala!

1149
01:47:14,210 --> 01:47:15,870
Osman.

1150
01:47:18,490 --> 01:47:20,160
You can't escape.

1151
01:47:20,740 --> 01:47:22,890
Not this time.

1152
01:47:30,040 --> 01:47:33,050
Do you know how a wolf traps his prey?

1153
01:47:34,840 --> 01:47:36,470
Alps!

1154
01:47:43,970 --> 01:47:46,470
- Allah is the greatest!
- Allah is the greatest!

1155
01:47:46,830 --> 01:47:48,380
Allah is the greatest!

1156
01:47:48,780 --> 01:47:50,100
Allah is the greatest!

1157
01:47:50,500 --> 01:47:53,800
- Allah is the greatest!
- Allah is the greatest!

1158
01:47:54,240 --> 01:47:56,160
Allah is the greatest!

1159
01:47:57,450 --> 01:47:58,430
Damn it!

1160
01:48:00,285 --> 01:48:01,625
What's it like now?

1161
01:48:02,240 --> 01:48:05,410
You trapped both us and Kantakuzenos!

1162
01:48:05,430 --> 01:48:09,120
- Let's go, Olof, they outnumber us.
- I can't leave him! I can't!

1163
01:48:14,570 --> 01:48:17,830
Let's go now, Olof! Let's go.

1164
01:48:21,780 --> 01:48:24,920
Thank you, alps.
Thank you.

1165
01:48:26,410 --> 01:48:28,730
We have one job left.
Come on!

1166
01:48:28,760 --> 01:48:30,730
Let's go, let's go.

1167
01:48:38,380 --> 01:48:39,860
We'll stay here for a while.

1168
01:48:40,110 --> 01:48:44,130
I do not want you to stay by my side while
the executioners are after me, Turgut Bey.

1169
01:48:44,380 --> 01:48:45,450
My Sultan.

1170
01:48:46,300 --> 01:48:48,300
We wake up to death every morning.

1171
01:48:48,640 --> 01:48:50,510
The future of our state
depends on you.

1172
01:48:51,000 --> 01:48:54,580
Our lives don't matter at this point.
Everything is for the state.

1173
01:48:55,220 --> 01:48:57,030
You sound like Osman Bey.

1174
01:48:59,030 --> 01:49:03,640
But now he is in the hands of Mother Sultan
with Bala Hatun.

1175
01:49:08,620 --> 01:49:11,870
We will get Osman Bey
and Bala Hatun safe and sound.

1176
01:49:12,580 --> 01:49:15,420
Care your own life right now,
Hadrat Sultan.

1177
01:49:19,620 --> 01:49:21,020
Can I come, my Bey?

1178
01:49:21,440 --> 01:49:22,360
Come!

1179
01:49:25,130 --> 01:49:29,950
My Bey, Malhun Hatun is emptying
Yenisehir by the order of Mother Sultan.

1180
01:49:32,910 --> 01:49:34,340
Mother Sultan!

1181
01:49:35,520 --> 01:49:37,040
I knew you wouldn't stop!

1182
01:49:38,420 --> 01:49:41,800
She takes advantage of my father's
absence and pressures us!

1183
01:49:42,710 --> 01:49:43,510
Let her.

1184
01:49:44,490 --> 01:49:46,660
We know how to overcome her.

1185
01:49:48,160 --> 01:49:49,160
Eyvallah.

1186
01:49:58,340 --> 01:49:59,110
Shepherd!

1187
01:50:00,550 --> 01:50:01,900
Isn't this taking too long?

1188
01:50:01,960 --> 01:50:03,760
Not at all, not at all.

1189
01:50:03,760 --> 01:50:05,420
It's a great relic.

1190
01:50:05,870 --> 01:50:08,070
Do you know what the relic is?

1191
01:50:08,180 --> 01:50:10,740
I know of course, it's my soul.

1192
01:50:11,990 --> 01:50:14,030
The soul is a very heavy load.

1193
01:50:14,390 --> 01:50:17,350
Both taking it and giving it, it's heavy,
Kantakuzenos!

1194
01:50:17,520 --> 01:50:19,350
You vile!

1195
01:50:20,870 --> 01:50:23,820
Kantakuzenos!

1196
01:50:26,390 --> 01:50:27,600
We came.

1197
01:50:29,420 --> 01:50:32,720
You are the one who delivers today,
Kantakuzenos.

1198
01:50:33,070 --> 01:50:34,360
We'll take your life.

1199
01:50:40,360 --> 01:50:43,230
You and your sordid plans, huh?

1200
01:50:43,580 --> 01:50:47,020
I have to get rid of you all
to end this.

1201
01:50:48,230 --> 01:50:49,540
Or you'll die.

1202
01:50:50,360 --> 01:50:52,550
Look, my brothers!

1203
01:50:52,550 --> 01:50:54,790
He never even thinks of his own death.

1204
01:50:54,790 --> 01:50:57,860
I will kill you first, you ignoble fox!

1205
01:50:58,740 --> 01:51:02,140
You will see what it is like to
lure a lion into a trap.

1206
01:51:08,600 --> 01:51:10,040
Well, what about the wolf?

1207
01:51:14,190 --> 01:51:15,960
Are your teeth stronger than his?

1208
01:51:17,830 --> 01:51:19,110
Osman.

1209
01:51:19,920 --> 01:51:23,320
Yes, Osman, Osman.

1210
01:51:23,480 --> 01:51:27,040
Olof, Olof, damn it!

1211
01:51:27,040 --> 01:51:30,910
The wrath of my Creator
against people like you is everlasting.

1212
01:51:30,910 --> 01:51:34,300
And I am the one who will end you now.

1213
01:51:34,700 --> 01:51:37,070
You are done.

1214
01:51:37,940 --> 01:51:41,240
Come and see Osman, come.

1215
01:51:41,240 --> 01:51:43,750
So you are calling your death, huh?

1216
01:52:42,040 --> 01:52:44,470
Yenişehir, Osman Bey's Palace.

1217
01:52:51,200 --> 01:52:54,100
Her name is not Ismihan,
her name must be the exam!

1218
01:52:54,100 --> 01:52:55,880
Allah bless you, Ulgen Hatun.

1219
01:52:55,880 --> 01:52:59,040
Am I not right?
She has been an exam we must bear with.

1220
01:52:59,040 --> 01:53:02,030
Damn her name.
She must die.

1221
01:53:02,030 --> 01:53:04,270
She will be tormented by her death, I hope.

1222
01:53:04,670 --> 01:53:07,720
I hope her liver comes out of her mouth!

1223
01:53:08,520 --> 01:53:09,420
Ulgen.

1224
01:53:12,200 --> 01:53:13,110
What, girl?

1225
01:53:13,480 --> 01:53:17,420
Can't I speak evil about an evil?

1226
01:53:19,020 --> 01:53:21,630
Tawbah Astaghfirullah!
(I seek forgiveness in Allah!)

1227
01:53:36,520 --> 01:53:40,390
Come on sons, let 's go
back to our tents.

1228
01:54:10,200 --> 01:54:13,470
Ayse, have you prepared everything?

1229
01:54:13,470 --> 01:54:16,140
We have everything ready.
We are ready.

1230
01:54:48,760 --> 01:54:52,060
Come on sons, come on.

1231
01:54:57,220 --> 01:54:59,920
Are you still here, Malhun Hatun.

1232
01:55:00,630 --> 01:55:03,790
You are being impatient, Bengi Hatun.

1233
01:55:03,790 --> 01:55:05,070
Of course I am.

1234
01:55:06,360 --> 01:55:10,670
The palace must be
well arranged for Mother Sultan.

1235
01:55:11,480 --> 01:55:16,430
It is well known that
her taste is different from yours.

1236
01:55:19,860 --> 01:55:21,380
She is from the state.

1237
01:55:26,110 --> 01:55:30,740
She is from the state.
What about you?

1238
01:55:33,980 --> 01:55:39,780
How can you still stand by Ismihan while
you know she's allied with Olof?

1239
01:55:40,910 --> 01:55:47,300
Forget about us, but don't you feel shame
after all your martyrs?

1240
01:55:54,280 --> 01:55:58,190
You are not perfect either, Ayse Hatun.

1241
01:56:00,060 --> 01:56:04,200
If you are not embarassed after
what you've done, I am not either.

1242
01:56:07,670 --> 01:56:11,510
Go on, the shorter the visit is the better.

1243
01:56:13,360 --> 01:56:15,720
Leave so that we can take care of our work.

1244
01:56:17,950 --> 01:56:18,820
Bengi.

1245
01:56:20,590 --> 01:56:22,070
You will regret it.

1246
01:56:23,100 --> 01:56:27,910
You will regret it so much.
But it'll be so late.

1247
01:56:31,590 --> 01:56:34,480
Ayse, come on.

1248
01:57:11,390 --> 01:57:15,120
Come on, sons, come on

1249
01:57:21,660 --> 01:57:23,800
Your reign is over now.

1250
01:57:27,860 --> 01:57:32,700
You have brought nothing but pain
to these landsç

1251
01:57:32,700 --> 01:57:36,230
No, you brought the pain.

1252
01:57:36,710 --> 01:57:39,940
We are the ones who relieve the pain.

1253
01:57:40,240 --> 01:57:43,220
But I will cut off your head
and relieve your pain too.

1254
01:57:45,000 --> 01:57:48,510
You trusted your numbers
and stood against us.

1255
01:57:49,190 --> 01:57:52,470
You trusted your armies,
you underestimated us.

1256
01:57:54,000 --> 01:58:04,180
Your only concern is gold, colonization,
creating chaos, and gathering strength

1257
01:58:05,980 --> 01:58:11,440
But our concern is to
bring order to the world.

1258
01:58:13,950 --> 01:58:16,270
We are on the right path.

1259
01:58:16,960 --> 01:58:21,460
He who is on the path of truth
will always be victorious...

1260
01:58:25,720 --> 01:58:28,640
...while falsehood will always be defeated.

1261
01:58:28,640 --> 01:58:29,670
Vengeance.

1262
01:58:32,160 --> 01:58:33,160
Vengeance.

1263
01:58:34,910 --> 01:58:37,580
They will avenge for me, Osman Bey.

1264
01:58:40,110 --> 01:58:48,470
We will burn your Hatuns and children and
even the bones of your dead!

1265
01:58:48,950 --> 01:58:52,190
We will erase you all from these lands.

1266
01:58:52,340 --> 01:58:56,230
No, you are the one are leaving.

1267
01:58:57,390 --> 01:58:59,940
You'll go to west, until the sea.

1268
01:59:04,000 --> 01:59:06,790
We will chase you until doomsday.

1269
01:59:06,790 --> 01:59:11,380
Either you will be expelled
or you will perish.

1270
01:59:14,310 --> 01:59:18,270
You'll see, you'll see.

1271
01:59:19,150 --> 01:59:25,310
You will see the death of
all your children and brothers in faith

1272
01:59:27,470 --> 01:59:29,110
But you won't.

1273
01:59:55,880 --> 01:59:58,260
- Boran!
- My Bey.

1274
02:00:02,160 --> 02:00:04,110
Send this to Ismihan.

1275
02:00:04,440 --> 02:00:06,380
Tell her this is Osman Bey's gift.

1276
02:00:06,380 --> 02:00:08,230
Yes my Bey.

1277
02:00:21,640 --> 02:00:26,840
And this is Andranikos' share.

1278
02:00:29,150 --> 02:00:32,980
- Give this to him
- Yes my Bey.

1279
02:00:34,390 --> 02:00:35,960
Bala.

1280
02:00:53,560 --> 02:00:57,860
My Bey, Mother Sultan expelled us
from Yenisehir.

1281
02:00:57,860 --> 02:01:01,350
She took over the city.
She sent Kayis to the tents.

1282
02:01:09,100 --> 02:01:14,860
Mother Sultan, Mother Sultan...

1283
02:01:17,760 --> 02:01:22,500
Okay then.
Okay then.

1284
02:01:23,780 --> 02:01:28,760
Shamil, prepare yourself, you'll
be out on the road tomorrow.

1285
02:01:28,760 --> 02:01:30,760
What is your order, my Bey?

1286
02:01:31,680 --> 02:01:39,020
You will go to Konya, you will announce
that Sultan Mesut is alive and free.

1287
02:01:39,020 --> 02:01:41,330
Sultan Mesut will sit on the throne.

1288
02:01:41,610 --> 02:01:45,690
But we must gather
the Beys and the people.

1289
02:01:46,920 --> 02:01:49,210
You will do whatever needs to be done.

1290
02:01:49,210 --> 02:01:52,910
You will convince those who
ask for money with money...

1291
02:01:52,910 --> 02:01:57,170
...those who seek war with war,
and those who seek peace with peace.

1292
02:01:57,170 --> 02:01:58,780
As you command, my Bey.

1293
02:02:03,740 --> 02:02:08,280
Ismihan.
We'll see.

1294
02:02:11,370 --> 02:02:17,730
Yes, Osman Bey.
I told you that you are not equal to me.

1295
02:02:18,160 --> 02:02:24,600
See, your throne is mine,
your castles are mine.

1296
02:02:25,480 --> 02:02:28,160
Yenisehir is mine.

1297
02:02:30,160 --> 02:02:36,500
Hadrat Mother Sultan, Osman must have
understood that he can't compete with you.

1298
02:02:36,600 --> 02:02:40,460
Of course,
just before taking his last breath.

1299
02:02:41,450 --> 02:02:45,330
I will establish a new order
in the border regions.

1300
02:02:46,460 --> 02:02:49,850
Osman's end became
a lesson for the people, my Sultan.

1301
02:02:50,900 --> 02:02:53,460
They saw whom they have to obey.

1302
02:02:54,520 --> 02:02:57,580
They saw, they saw

1303
02:02:58,520 --> 02:03:02,290
You were always by my side on this plan,
Bengi Hatun.

1304
02:03:03,800 --> 02:03:05,330
And you too, Beys.

1305
02:03:10,280 --> 02:03:12,970
I will never forget what you did.

1306
02:03:16,570 --> 02:03:19,900
You will rule the market from now on.

1307
02:03:22,080 --> 02:03:24,440
Oktem Bey, Bengi Hatun.

1308
02:03:26,900 --> 02:03:28,900
Yes, Mother Sultan.

1309
02:03:31,920 --> 02:03:34,840
What will happen to Kayi tribe,
Mother Sultan?

1310
02:03:37,060 --> 02:03:41,850
How can a headless tribe end up,
Bengi Hatun?

1311
02:03:44,940 --> 02:03:47,080
Osman Bey is not there anymore.

1312
02:03:47,930 --> 02:03:52,320
The end of the Kayi will,
of course, be in our hands.

1313
02:03:58,140 --> 02:04:02,160
- Can I come in, my Sultan?
- Come, Avci.

1314
02:04:11,090 --> 02:04:13,260
Sent by Osman Bey.

1315
02:04:41,690 --> 02:04:43,920
Osman!

1316
02:05:15,930 --> 02:05:17,980
Osman Bey is coming!

1317
02:05:18,040 --> 02:05:22,640
- Good news
- Osman Bey is coming.

1318
02:05:22,640 --> 02:05:25,420
Praise be to my Allah.

1319
02:05:41,540 --> 02:05:50,090
- Welcome, my Bey!
. - Welcome!

1320
02:05:50,090 --> 02:05:54,680
- Welcome, Osman Bey!
- Welcome, Osman Bey!

1321
02:05:54,680 --> 02:06:04,800
- Welcome, Osman Bey!
. - Welcome, my Bey!

1322
02:06:20,650 --> 02:06:22,420
O Allah.

1323
02:06:23,260 --> 02:06:25,930
- Kids!
- Father!

1324
02:06:26,640 --> 02:06:28,740
My little one.

1325
02:06:35,120 --> 02:06:38,930
My little one, little one.

1326
02:06:38,930 --> 02:06:43,880
- Father.
- Son.

1327
02:06:50,210 --> 02:06:54,360
- My Bey.
- Orhan.

1328
02:06:56,980 --> 02:06:58,060
My Bey.

1329
02:07:00,060 --> 02:07:02,680
Thank Allah very much
you are back safe and sound, my Bey.

1330
02:07:03,040 --> 02:07:06,400
Yes I am, I am.

1331
02:07:07,700 --> 02:07:08,420
Bala.

1332
02:07:12,850 --> 02:07:14,360
Welcome my Bey.

1333
02:07:15,010 --> 02:07:16,480
Thank you.

1334
02:07:18,610 --> 02:07:21,400
- My Bey!
- Kumral Abdal.

1335
02:07:25,260 --> 02:07:26,690
Let's go.

1336
02:07:49,530 --> 02:07:55,210
Here we are, at the place where
our mighty tree was planted.

1337
02:07:55,560 --> 02:07:57,150
We are in our tents.

1338
02:07:59,710 --> 02:08:02,640
We will never stop until we end the ones...

1339
02:08:03,450 --> 02:08:07,710
...who always wanted to end us.

1340
02:08:12,550 --> 02:08:13,840
Allah is the greatest!

1341
02:08:13,980 --> 02:08:28,660
Allah is the greatest!

1342
02:08:31,340 --> 02:08:37,660
My Sultan, I sent a messenger to the towns
where we shall camp on the road to Konya.

1343
02:08:38,970 --> 02:08:42,350
Are you wondering why we did not camp
in the caravanserai, Vizier?

1344
02:08:43,690 --> 02:08:45,640
That question is beyond me, my Sultan.

1345
02:08:45,860 --> 02:08:48,770
Osman's rebellion courages
the other Beys.

1346
02:08:50,020 --> 02:08:55,040
I will break their courage with my army
and strengthen their loyalty to me.

1347
02:08:55,440 --> 02:08:59,790
The enormity of your army
will silence the Beys, my Sultan.

1348
02:09:00,320 --> 02:09:04,820
But if we do not cut off Osman's head...

1349
02:09:04,880 --> 02:09:06,930
...Beys may rebel.

1350
02:09:07,250 --> 02:09:13,020
My mother will not stop until she cuts
off Osman and Mesut's heads.

1351
02:09:14,620 --> 02:09:17,640
We shall take care of the other
beys in the meantime

1352
02:09:44,000 --> 02:09:46,810
Shadows surrounded my eyes and heart.

1353
02:09:48,510 --> 02:09:50,510
I was wrong, Osman Bey.

1354
02:09:55,260 --> 02:09:57,120
I disappointed this sword...

1355
02:09:58,450 --> 02:10:01,020
...that I have been carrying for years...

1356
02:10:03,450 --> 02:10:05,230
...to spread justice.

1357
02:10:09,470 --> 02:10:11,150
I am not worthy of it.

1358
02:10:13,600 --> 02:10:15,480
Take my sword.

1359
02:10:16,100 --> 02:10:18,520
Take it so I remember where I was wrong.

1360
02:10:20,060 --> 02:10:21,620
Take it, Osman Bey.

1361
02:10:27,260 --> 02:10:29,200
Whenever the right finds its course...

1362
02:10:30,270 --> 02:10:32,270
...and you think I deserve it back...

1363
02:10:34,080 --> 02:10:36,710
...then I will get this
true friend of mine back.

1364
02:10:41,620 --> 02:10:44,490
The exam you failed in
ended many lives.

1365
02:10:45,300 --> 02:10:47,230
Never fall into headlessness again.

1366
02:10:49,230 --> 02:10:51,090
And don't turn your back again.

1367
02:10:51,670 --> 02:10:53,680
I understand now that
turning my back to you...

1368
02:10:54,040 --> 02:10:56,100
...was turning my back to myself.

1369
02:10:56,380 --> 02:10:58,680
Damn me if I turn my back again.

1370
02:11:00,400 --> 02:11:01,840
Let this be your last mistake.

1371
02:11:03,990 --> 02:11:06,240
If you deviate from our cause again...

1372
02:11:08,990 --> 02:11:11,120
I will not give you my hand to reach...

1373
02:11:12,640 --> 02:11:14,640
I will step on you and go on.

1374
02:11:25,390 --> 02:11:27,920
This sword is for men just like you.

1375
02:11:33,800 --> 02:11:35,250
Eyvallah Osman Bey.

1376
02:11:39,750 --> 02:11:41,900
May Allah bless our war.

1377
02:11:48,220 --> 02:11:49,290
Amen.

1378
02:11:52,040 --> 02:11:54,130
Come on, let's eat.

1379
02:12:22,120 --> 02:12:24,480
He will be fine, right, Kumral Abdal?

1380
02:12:26,200 --> 02:12:28,490
Heal comes from Allah.

1381
02:12:29,260 --> 02:12:31,010
He will be fine, Inshallah.

1382
02:12:31,920 --> 02:12:33,030
Inshallah.

1383
02:12:33,200 --> 02:12:34,250
Inshallah.

1384
02:12:40,150 --> 02:12:42,300
In The Name of Allah Most Gracious Most Merciful

1385
02:12:45,840 --> 02:12:48,170
In The Name of Allah Most Gracious Most Merciful

1386
02:13:03,400 --> 02:13:07,540
When he drinks this, the poison will vanish,
right, Komral Abdul?

1387
02:13:07,750 --> 02:13:10,930
I don't know if this will work or not.

1388
02:13:11,960 --> 02:13:16,190
But if I don't give it to him now,
he'll not make it another day.

1389
02:13:16,390 --> 02:13:18,030
He may die.

1390
02:13:18,860 --> 02:13:20,350
Be optimistic, alps.

1391
02:13:20,670 --> 02:13:22,710
We will do our best.

1392
02:13:23,250 --> 02:13:25,040
Inshallah, Kumral Abdal.

1393
02:13:32,000 --> 02:13:34,180
Oh my Creator, You are the healer.

1394
02:13:34,920 --> 02:13:36,560
Heal comes from you.

1395
02:13:37,180 --> 02:13:39,500
Don't let us make mistakes.

1396
02:13:39,760 --> 02:13:40,660
Amen.

1397
02:13:41,120 --> 02:13:42,150
Amen.

1398
02:13:42,740 --> 02:13:44,760
In The Name of Allah Most Gracious Most Merciful

1399
02:13:47,420 --> 02:13:49,040
O Healer!

1400
02:13:50,410 --> 02:13:51,980
O Healer!

1401
02:13:52,710 --> 02:13:54,060
O Healer!

1402
02:14:13,640 --> 02:14:15,650
Kantakouzanos died.

1403
02:14:20,700 --> 02:14:22,140
What do we do now?

1404
02:14:25,500 --> 02:14:28,310
Will the crucifix
you put on your neck save us?

1405
02:14:34,870 --> 02:14:36,370
Olof.

1406
02:14:37,090 --> 02:14:40,210
You believed that crucifix like a fool!

1407
02:14:41,150 --> 02:14:42,930
You forgot our goal.

1408
02:14:43,640 --> 02:14:45,380
You forgot Odin.

1409
02:14:47,140 --> 02:14:51,890
We came here to have a land, Frigg.

1410
02:14:53,240 --> 02:14:54,540
And we will have one.

1411
02:14:55,230 --> 02:14:59,500
Whether with or without Kantakouzanos.

1412
02:14:59,930 --> 02:15:01,360
We must!

1413
02:15:08,380 --> 02:15:11,430
Otherwise, you will have lived through
this scandal in vain.

1414
02:15:13,340 --> 02:15:14,620
You are...

1415
02:15:17,750 --> 02:15:22,630
...you think I left Odin for my own good.

1416
02:15:25,840 --> 02:15:28,770
I did not choose Jesus for this reason.

1417
02:15:30,230 --> 02:15:35,020
You'll understand
why I did this when the time comes.

1418
02:15:36,110 --> 02:15:37,840
I will end Osman.

1419
02:15:39,280 --> 02:15:43,550
I will avenge for all my lost friends
when he dies.

1420
02:15:46,260 --> 02:15:47,820
How will you do that?

1421
02:15:48,530 --> 02:15:50,270
I'll take the land.

1422
02:15:51,960 --> 02:15:56,020
The only force here is not Kantakouzanos.

1423
02:15:58,070 --> 02:16:01,320
There are other friends
with whom I will agree.

1424
02:16:02,400 --> 02:16:03,440
Who?

1425
02:16:05,650 --> 02:16:06,970
You'll see.

1426
02:16:15,070 --> 02:16:16,320
Osman.

1427
02:16:17,010 --> 02:16:19,360
He is being himself!

1428
02:16:19,760 --> 02:16:21,930
He proved his disobedience again!

1429
02:16:22,860 --> 02:16:25,870
Do you know what will happen
at the end of this?

1430
02:16:30,530 --> 02:16:34,100
The Byzantine army will come to our lands.

1431
02:16:36,840 --> 02:16:40,389
Osman Bey stirred up chaos
at the borders again!

1432
02:16:40,799 --> 02:16:42,830
He messed up the system again!

1433
02:16:45,478 --> 02:16:47,818
He, who did this to Kantakuzenos...

1434
02:16:49,058 --> 02:16:50,770
...can do anything to us.

1435
02:17:02,440 --> 02:17:06,520
Is your fear greater than
your loyalty, Bayindir Bey?

1436
02:17:06,879 --> 02:17:09,510
I ask forgiveness from Allah,
Hadrat Mother Sultan.

1437
02:17:11,139 --> 02:17:13,639
I just want stability.

1438
02:17:14,580 --> 02:17:16,790
As you ordered...

1439
02:17:17,430 --> 02:17:19,610
I want our system to continue.

1440
02:17:21,120 --> 02:17:22,799
It doesn't happen by talking.

1441
02:17:31,478 --> 02:17:34,280
Will we kill Osman, Mother Sultan?

1442
02:17:46,469 --> 02:17:47,790
No.

1443
02:17:48,719 --> 02:17:50,690
We will not kill him.

1444
02:17:53,360 --> 02:17:55,940
We will support him.

1445
02:18:00,940 --> 02:18:03,290
It's time to unite.

1446
02:18:04,978 --> 02:18:07,100
What unity are you talking about,
Mother Sultan?

1447
02:18:09,670 --> 02:18:14,139
To unite with the man who
causes us terrible troubles?!

1448
02:18:14,889 --> 02:18:18,620
You promised me for revenge.

1449
02:18:22,058 --> 02:18:24,308
We'll take revenge.

1450
02:18:25,219 --> 02:18:29,879
And we will take everything
from Osman's hand.

1451
02:18:36,280 --> 02:18:40,068
Osman will have only his life.

1452
02:18:45,500 --> 02:18:47,799
We'll make him worse than dead.

1453
02:18:48,318 --> 02:18:52,750
He will see the collapse
of the entire system he established.

1454
02:18:56,959 --> 02:19:00,680
Our brother Konur will recover, Inshallah.

1455
02:19:01,190 --> 02:19:03,129
- Inshallah.
- Inshallah.

1456
02:19:04,389 --> 02:19:06,120
We are in our tents again.

1457
02:19:07,340 --> 02:19:09,219
And together again.

1458
02:19:11,200 --> 02:19:14,610
Praise be to Allah
who has given us tables like this.

1459
02:19:14,610 --> 02:19:16,020
Amen.

1460
02:19:16,930 --> 02:19:22,260
Praise be to Allah Almighty, who brought
us together safe and sound.

1461
02:19:22,260 --> 02:19:23,770
Amen.

1462
02:19:24,799 --> 02:19:26,478
Let's eat.

1463
02:19:27,219 --> 02:19:29,450
In The Name of Allah Most Gracious Most Merciful

1464
02:19:39,370 --> 02:19:42,159
My brother Orhan has something
to tell you, father.

1465
02:19:47,629 --> 02:19:48,850
Say it.

1466
02:19:50,120 --> 02:19:51,390
Osman Bey.

1467
02:19:52,740 --> 02:19:54,360
Where is the relic?

1468
02:20:00,660 --> 02:20:02,280
You will know...

1469
02:20:04,000 --> 02:20:05,820
...when you grow up.

1470
02:20:08,440 --> 02:20:10,610
How much more
will they grow up, Osman Bey?

1471
02:20:10,760 --> 02:20:14,020
These valiants...
they have done a great job.

1472
02:20:14,020 --> 02:20:16,750
They saved the great Sultan Mesut.

1473
02:20:20,270 --> 02:20:25,190
You also wonder, but you use my Beys
as an excuse, Turgut.

1474
02:20:30,140 --> 02:20:32,350
Say it then.
Come on.

1475
02:20:49,270 --> 02:20:51,500
Bala, help me with this.

1476
02:21:35,850 --> 02:21:38,190
So you never left it, right father?

1477
02:21:41,150 --> 02:21:43,990
I told you, brother,
it's always with him.

1478
02:21:44,890 --> 02:21:48,400
There was no way else to protect it
for all those years.

1479
02:21:49,950 --> 02:21:52,030
But this is not the real one.

1480
02:21:55,230 --> 02:21:57,280
Just in case...

1481
02:21:57,810 --> 02:22:01,200
I have been carrying it for a long time for
them to find it on me.

1482
02:22:01,530 --> 02:22:03,830
Stop the game already, Osman Bey.

1483
02:22:04,030 --> 02:22:05,720
There is no enemy here.

1484
02:22:05,720 --> 02:22:07,250
Where is the relic?

1485
02:22:08,600 --> 02:22:12,160
It's at my sheikh.
Only he knows where it is.

1486
02:22:17,070 --> 02:22:22,130
So we don't have any information
even if they threaten us to kill?

1487
02:22:24,170 --> 02:22:25,890
This is the best.

1488
02:22:26,100 --> 02:22:28,120
Even I don't know where it is.

1489
02:22:31,350 --> 02:22:32,330
Grandfather.

1490
02:22:34,070 --> 02:22:35,780
You won't reveal it, will you?

1491
02:22:39,170 --> 02:22:43,350
I don't know,
let me think first, Aladdin.

1492
02:22:47,520 --> 02:22:49,520
Oh I forgot.

1493
02:23:01,540 --> 02:23:02,680
Sons!

1494
02:23:04,130 --> 02:23:06,770
Don't go after the relic.

1495
02:23:08,020 --> 02:23:12,340
When the time comes
it will reveal itself.

1496
02:23:16,880 --> 02:23:21,640
Just like how our dream of being a state
was a secret all the time...

1497
02:23:23,110 --> 02:23:26,880
Now it is time to reveal the state
we will found.

1498
02:23:32,980 --> 02:23:51,460
Visit our website for more: turkision.com